<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">Engungwel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan wu Emwɛn e Dzaã</para>
  <para style="toc2">Emwɛn e Dzaã</para>
  <para style="toc3">Emw</para>
  <para style="mt1">Emwɛn e Dzaã</para>
  <para style="imt1">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wu «Emwɛn» oluul m'ãndɔɔ mã m'edziɔɔn. Nkuũ a ɔ̃nkaan wu esuo kwɛn Nziã áyɛɛl Dzaã ãndɔɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 1:1">1.1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃swɛn-ɔ̃nkaan wu eli ntam Dzaã. Akiool abeyɛɛn ndiri ndɛ wuwu wu ákel Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ãnã yi me nkuũ a ndɛ. Bɔ bvool abeyɛɛn ndiri ndɛ hɛ̃ wu ákel ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃tyel mi me nkuũ a ndɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wu, onge b'áswɛn ndɛ me lio lɛn okwɛn o Domityɛn al'oyii ke ntɔ. Me lio olɔ, al'ayii atuaal akiool mpal yam bibi me nsie yi ke nsɛn okwɛn o Lom, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ ákekiool ndiri Mfam wu abuɛɛn kɛn a Yeso Mãsia. Dzaã áswɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu ŋ'al'eyii ndɛ ekukwel. Ndɛ áswɛn ndɛ ŋ'éli ndɛ m'onzii k'esanga ki ata me Patimos (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 1:9">1.9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Dzaã áyuɔɔl ɔ̃nkaan wu ol'ãbvɔɔn nsiaan m'etswi e nsie ki Adzi minɛɛl (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 2">2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3">3</ref></char>). Etswi e nsie okyɛ eli ɔ̃kiri wa Tuuki wa meba.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wu, akoo k'akab ndɛ m'ebaal bva:</para>
  <para style="io">1. Dzaã omwɛn Yeso wu asiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 1">1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">2. Ɛ̃nkaan mi ayuɔɔl ãbvɔɔn nsiaan (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 2-3">2–3</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io">3. Ãbwel nsiaan (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 4:1-8:6">4.1–8.6</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io">4. Amvel-a-mvel nsiaan (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 8:7-11:19">8.7–11.19</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io">5. Eliĩ nsiaan (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 12:1-15:4">12.1–15.4</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io">6. Asaan nsiaan ba mpuru a Nziã (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 15:5-16:21">15.5–16.21</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io">7. Ãndɔɔ nsiaã m'ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ a Babilon (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 17:1-19:10">17.1–19.10</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io">8. Emwɛn nsiaan bvi esuo emfa ki èyesiɛɛn ɔ̃kiri (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 19:11-21:8">19.11–21.8</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io">9. Yelusalem wa meba, wu ɔ̃nkal a Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 21:9-22:5">21.9–22.5</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Otsɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan wu bɛn «Nziã áwi Yeso Mãsia emwɛn me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ asuo asal a ndɛ mɛn ãbvaan ãsa ãya» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 1:1">1.1</ref></char>). M'ɔ̃nkaan wu, Nziã odzii k'asuo akiool kwɛn ndɛ akieel atsiil ãndɔɔ ã baal b'ɔ̃kiri me ndɔɔ ãmpal m'ebetuaal bɔ bɔ, bvool kwɛn obi kieel k'obekal y'okwɛn ɔ̃bu nkal akiool wɛ. Nziã hɛ̃ odzii k'asuo bɔ kwɛn osiool o Yeso odzweel nkuul yi esam akiool onse ɔ̃kiri wu ɔ̃nyiɔɔn wu èyebuo ndɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wu ayeel akiool k'akal angɔ-mwiĩ ye k'eya «Wu oli, wu áli, bvool wu aya» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 1:4">1.4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:8">1.8</ref></char>). Ɔ̃nkaan wu hɛ̃ asuo kwɛn Ebvɔɔn lueel bwɛn Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal abeyɛɛn ndiri: «Mfam Yeso, ya» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 22:20">22.20</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="s1">Obɛɛn b'emwɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Emwɛn e Yeso Mãsia li éwi Nziã ndɛ me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ asuo asal a ndɛ mɛn ãbvaan ãsa ãya. Ndɛ osuo lɔ ŋ'eyuɔɔl ndɛ ãnzwel ã ndɛ ol'ɔ̃sal a ndɛ Dzaã. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Ndɛ wu Dzaã otsweel ndiri m'emwɛn ndɛ ãli Endɔɔ e Nziã bvool ãli otaa-taa b'eyɛɛl Yeso Mãsia ndɛ. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Esɛ ngamfɛn ola wu atsiɔ Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã wu. Esɛ ngamfɛn hɛ̃ ola b'ayoo ãyɛɛn m'ãfi ola Nziã bvool asa m'akel onse Ɔ̃nkaan ondɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, lio eyii tsotsoo.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio ol'ãbvɔɔn nsiaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Mɛ̃ wu Dzaã nkel ɔ̃nkaan wu m'ãbvɔɔn nsiaan mã k'etswi e nsie ki Adzi. Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã wu oli, wu áli, bvool wu aya, andɔɔl byɛ kuɔɔl, awa byɛ opi, b'ofi ol'ɛ̃fel nsiaan mi ɛ̃li ke nkwel a kiri e ndɛ li okwɛn. <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />Ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl y'opi obɔ ofi hɛ̃ ola Yeso Mãsia, wu ɔ̃tsweel wa taa-taa, wu ásiool ɛ̃kwel onse b'ákwi-ákwi, bvool wu oli Mfam a akwɛn a nsie. Ndɛ wu odzii bia-byɛ, bvool opaal bia-byɛ onse ãbi m'ãkel ã ndɛ.<verse eid="REV 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />Ndɛ osi kwɛn bia-byɛ ekal baal b'okwɛn o Nziã, bvool osuul bia-byɛ angaa-a-Nziã me ndɔɔ yi esal me ndɔɔ a Nziã wu Tal a ndɛ. Yɔɔl kwɛn lweel y'omfam ekal bvi ndɛ ɔ̃bu! Amɛn! <verse eid="REV 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Etal, ndɛ aya onse epɛn, bvool baal bueel akieel amwɛn ndɛ, onkyam b'átab ndɛ ebɛɛ. Ãyam ã nsie mbueel ãkieel ãkal me mpiri me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. Ngwanyã, amɛn! <verse eid="REV 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Mfam Nziã olieel ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ndyam ndi Obɛɛn y'Osɛɛl, wu ɛ̃kwel ye wa ntɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bakyɛ ati «Obɛɛn» y'«Osɛɛl» m'«Alefa» y'«Omega»</char></note>. Mɛ̃ ndi wu oli, wu áli, bvool wu aya. Mɛ̃ ndi Nziã-Nga-Waan.»<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dzaã omwɛn Mãsia onse lweel e ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Mɛ̃ wu Dzaã, mɛ̃ ndi ndoo a byɛ. Mɛ̃ ndi bvoo ye byɛ onse ãmpal, onse Okwɛn o Nziã bvool y'osɛ-mwiĩ me bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Yeso. Mɛ̃ éli k'esanga ki ata me Patimos me ndɔɔ Endɔɔ e Nziã, y'otsweel b'ebetsweel mɛ̃ Yeso. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Me tsoo e Mfam, Ɔ̃fel osiin mɛ̃. Mɛ̃ bu ngyoo nkii yi kokɔ onge nkii a mvel-a-mvel ke mbee a mɛ̃. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />Nkii oyɔ ékeyɛɛn ndiri: «M'emwɛn yɛ, kel mɔ̃ onse ɔ̃nkaan, yuɔɔl ndɛ ãbvɔɔn nsiaan mã: Efedze, Simiine, Pɛɛgame, Tiatiil, Saades, Filadelefi ye Lahodise.» <verse eid="REV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Mɛ̃ nkɔɔl ntal mbee, me ndɔɔ yi etal wu ákeyɛɛn ye mɛ̃. Ŋe nkɔɔl mɛ̃ ntal mbee, mɛ̃ mwɛn eluɔ nsiaan bvi abendɔɔl ambunda bvi ábuo me ɔɔl. <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />Mpɛɛ̃-a-mpɛɛ̃ eluɔ nsiaan bvi abendɔɔl ambunda obvɛ, éli ye wu áli m'emfa ki mbuul. Ndɛ álaal ɔ̃nkuru wu ɔ̃la, bvool álaal ɔ̃sii wa ɔɔl me luu. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Ɔ̃tswɛ ye mfu e ndɛ éli bvam fuu kɛɛn. Mviil ã ndɛ ã́kengal mam onge mbaa. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />Ntaã e ndɛ ékenyɛɛn onge bvieel li ata me bolonze li alɔ onse mbaa yi kokɔ. Nkii a ndɛ ékesiaan onge epoo e nzal yi nɛn. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Onse kuɔɔl e ndɛ ki elam, éli y'anga-a-ngam nsiaan. Onse ɔ̃nywã a ndɛ, epwel ki ápɛɛl ékepal. Osu o ndɛ óli onge mwiĩ wu ata nzie. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Ŋ'emwɛn mɛ̃ ndɛ, mɛ̃ mvi ke ntaã e ndɛ onge mbuul wu okwi. Ndɛ bu andɔɔl mɛ̃ kuɔɔl e ndɛ ki elam y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: «Bee buɔ obal! Mɛ̃ ndyam ndi mbuul wu ɛ̃kwel bvool wa ntɔ. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Mɛ̃ ndi wa mwiĩ hɛ̃. Mɛ̃ ékwii, kɛn a meba mɛ̃ nsiool ɔ̃bu, bvool mɛ̃ ndi y'okwɛn nkal epfu bvool nkal ola o b'ákwi-ákwi. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Oŋɔ̃ kel m'emwɛn yɛ, m'ãbebwel meba, ye m'ãkieel aya ke mbee. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Me b'otal otsɛn bo m'edziɔɔn b'angam-a-ngam nsiaan b'emwɛn yɛ onse kuɔɔl e mɛ̃ ki elam, ye b'eluɔ nsiaan bvi abendɔɔl ambunda bvi ási me ɔɔl, angam-a-ngam nsiaan ali ãnzwel m'ãbvɔɔn nsiaan, eluɔ nsiaan bvi abendɔɔl ambunda bvi ási me ɔɔl eli ãbvɔɔn nsiaan.»<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nkaan wu akel ebvɔɔn li bviil li Efedze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />«Kel ãnzwel m'ebvɔɔn li bviil li Efedze ɔ̃nkaan bubu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:1">“Tal m'eyɛɛn wu osiin angam-a-ngam nsiaan onse kuɔɔl e ndɛ ki elam, bvool wu adzuu mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ eluɔ nsiaan bvi ɔɔl bvi abendɔɔl ambunda: <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ yɛ, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ fool li ebemwɛn yɛ m'ɔ̃sal y'osɛ-mwiĩ o yɛ. Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ngyɛɛ kwɛn yɛ k'akoo k'akiool baal b'abi wɛ. Yɛ kie ɔ̃kwal a b'abeyɛɛn ndiri bɔ ali antam, kwɛn ŋɛn bɔ k'ali bɔ wɛ, yɛ bu paal bɔ anga-amfya. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Yɛ li y'osɛ-mwiĩ, yɛ mwɛn fool me nkuũ a mɛ̃, ke wɔɔl wɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Kɛn a ndɔɔ yi mbyel mɛ̃ ola yɛ yɔ yi: Yɛ ke bekal ye dzii li éli a yɛ ŋ'ɛ̃kwel wɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Obobɔ, yeel mboo yi ebvi yɛ, kaal ɔ̃kwal a yɛ, bvool sa ãndɔɔ m'ékesa yɛ ŋ'ɛ̃kwel. Okɛɛn yɛ ke kaal ɔ̃kwal wɛ, mɛ̃ èya ola yɛ, bvool mɛ̃ èmbaal eluɔ e yɛ ki ɔɔl ki abendɔɔl ambunda ke mboo a kyɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Kɛn a ndɔɔ yi mvɛ ola yɛ yɔ yi: Yɛ abebyal ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ baal ba nkel a Anikolayite, onge b'ebebyal mɛ̃ hɛ̃.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />Yɔɔl kwɛn wa y'ãtswi, ayoo m'eyɛɛn Ɔ̃fel ãbvɔɔn! Mbuul wu abvel mpɛn, mɛ̃ èwa ndɛ nkuul yi adza esia li ɔ̃ti wu elaã, wu oli onse paladi a Nziã.”»<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nkaan wu akel ebvɔɔn li bviil li Simiine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />«Kel ãnzwel m'ebvɔɔn li bviil li Simiine ɔ̃nkaan bubu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">“Tal m'eyɛɛn wu oli mbuul wu ɛ̃kwel bvool wa ntɔ, wu ákwi bvool ásiool: <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ fool y'oywal o yɛ, kwɛn ŋɛn yɛ ɔ̃pfel li. Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ kwee li ebekwee baal yɛ. Baal obɔ abeyɛɛn ndiri bɔ ali Ayuda, kwɛn ŋɛn bɔ k'ali bɔ wɛ. Bɔ ali nkel a baal a Satana. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Oyɛɛ ke kal bam ye buɔ me fool li èmwɛn yɛ wɛ. Tal: Ɔ̃pfu àtyal bakyɛ onse byɛ me bwal, me ndɔɔ yi ambio byɛ. Byɛ èmwɛn fool ãtsoo kuun. Kuru nzuru me mɛ̃ tiil epfu, m'emfa okyɛ mɛ̃ èwa yɛ ekɔrɔ ki elaã.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Yɔɔl kwɛn wa y'ãtswi, ayoo m'eyɛɛn Ɔ̃fel ãbvɔɔn! Wu akieel abvel mpɛn, epfu li nsa yuaal k'etuaal ndɛ mpal wɛ.”»<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nkaan wu akel ebvɔɔn li bviil li Pɛɛgame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />«Kel ãnzwel m'ebvɔɔn li bviil li Pɛɛgame ɔ̃nkaan bubu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">“Tal m'eyɛɛn wu oli y'epwel ki ápɛɛl: <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ mboo yi ekal yɛ ngesɛ. Oyɔ mboo yi eli kiri li okwɛn li Satana. Yɛ kuru nzuru me nkuũ a mɛ̃, bvool ke yɔɔl k'akiool mɛ̃ wɛ, onkyam m'ãtsoo m'ábam Antipas wu áli ɔ̃tsweel a mɛ̃ wa taa-taa, ola byɛ ke mboo yi ekal Satana. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Kɛn ãndɔɔ ke kwɛ me mbyel mɛ̃ ola yɛ mɔ̃ mã: Ola yɛ, eli ye baal b'akuru nzuru m'ãtee ã Balam. Ndɛ wu ákewa ɔ̃kwɛn Balak luo li aywiin Afi-Isalayel bɛɛ, ŋ'éketam ndɛ bɔ k'adza anyam b'áwi ãkab ol'etiɔ, bvool k'atiɔ Nziã wa taa-taa eboo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Otiɔ o Nziã eboo ŋã, ŋ'ayɔɔl Nziã wa taa-taa m'obuɛɛn b'etiɔ. Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ata ndɔɔ oyɔ m'osa b'ãndɔɔ m'esio. Etal onse Odze 1. 2.</char></note>. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Emfa kiki, ola yɛ hɛ̃, yɛ eli ye baal b'akuru nzuru m'ãtee ã baal ba nkel a Anikolayite. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Oŋɔ̃ kaal ɔ̃kwal, okɛɛn k'obobɔ wɛ, mɛ̃ ŋ'esa eya ola yɛ, bvool edzɔɔ bɔ eta m'epwel ki epal onse ɔ̃nywã a mɛ̃.<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Yɔɔl kwɛn wa y'ãtswi, ayoo m'eyɛɛn Ɔ̃fel ãbvɔɔn! Wu akieel abvel mpɛn, mɛ̃ èwa ndɛ mane wu áli m'edziɔɔn bvool èwa ndɛ nkɔɔn yi fuu. Nkal a nkɔɔn oyɔ, ápuul nkuũ yi enyiɔɔn yɛn mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'akoo k'atsiɔ yɔ wɛ, wu atsiɔ yɔ kɛn a wu obɔɔ yɔ.”»<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nkaan wu akel ebvɔɔn li bviil li Tiatiil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />«Kel ãnzwel m'ebvɔɔn li bviil li Tiatiil ɔ̃nkaan bubu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">“Tal m'eyɛɛn Muaan a Nziã, wɛn mviil ãli onge elam e mbaa yi kokɔ, bvool wɛn ntaã eli onge bvieel li bolonze li enyɛɛn. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ yɛ, ye dzii e yɛ, y'okiool o yɛ, ɔ̃sal wu ebesa yɛ, y'osɛ-mwiĩ o yɛ. Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ ngesɛ wɛn ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ yɛ mi ãmbee ɛ̃nduru mi ɛ̃kwel olɔɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Kɛn a ndɔɔ yi mbyel mɛ̃ ola yɛ yɔ yi: Ɔ̃bvu-ayi Dzodzabel, wu abeyɛɛn ndiri ndɛ ɔ̃liaal-ɔ̃kiɛɛn, yɛ abewa ndɛ nkuul yi apfuru asal a mɛ̃, ŋ'ebewa ndɛ bɔ luo li atiɔ Nziã wa taa-taa eboo, bvool li adza anyam b'awi ãkab ol'etiɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Mɛ̃ ngwi ndɛ mpwee yi akaal ɔ̃kwal, kɛn a ndɛ k'adzii k'ayɔɔl k'atiɔ mɛ̃ eboo wɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ ètyal ndɛ nkal a ntal yi fool li bibi, ndɛ y'andoo b'abesa ãndɔɔ m'esio ye ndɛ. Kɛn a ŋɛn bɔ akaal ɛ̃kwal, bvool k'abesa ãndɔɔ onge ndɛ wɛ, ndɔɔ oyɔ k'èya me bɔ wɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Mɛ̃ ètam k'abweel ayio a ndɛ. M'emfa okyɛ, ãbvɔɔn mbueel ãkieel ãyɛɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ ndi wu ebebwɛɛl ãtsam y'efua e baal. Mɛ̃ esa mbuul bwɛn a mbuul m'emfa ki ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Me b'otal byɛ b'akiool ba Tiatiil b'esiil, byɛ bɛn k'ekuru nzuru m'ãtee mã mfya omɔ̃ wɛ, bvool k'ekiool k'ebii k'eyɛɛ m'ebeta bɔ me <char style="em">dzio li ãndɔɔ</char> ã Satana wɛ, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn wɛn, mɛ̃ k'endɔɔl pfuũ ekyam nkal a byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Kɛn a byɛ esɛn ãnã onse m'eli a byɛ, tiil k'èya mɛ̃. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Wu akieel abvel mpɛn bvool akieel asal kɛn osal m'emfa ki ãtee ã mɛ̃ tiil ntɔ, mɛ̃ èwa ndɛ okwɛn nkal ɛ̃kiri. <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />Ndɛ akieel abiri ɛ̃kiri omyɛ̃ ye nkoo yueel, bvool akieel abwel myɛ̃ onge b'abwel asaan b'abuo m'ɔ̃bwɛɛ, <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />onge b'éyɔɔ mɛ̃ okwɛn ola Tal a mɛ̃. Mɛ̃ bvool èwa wu obvel mpɛn ngam-a-ngam wu epal-epal.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Yɔɔl kwɛn wa y'ãtswi, ayoo m'eyɛɛn Ɔ̃fel ãbvɔɔn!”»<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nkaan wu ayuɔɔl ebvɔɔn li bviil li Saades</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />«Kel ãnzwel m'ebvɔɔn li bviil li Saades ɔ̃nkaan bubu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">“Yoo m'eyɛɛn wu oli y'ɛ̃fel ɛ̃ Nziã nsiaan y'angam-a-ngam nsiaan: Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ yɛ. Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ bam ngesɛ wɛn nkuũ a yɛ ebeyi nsia ndiri yɛ li mwiĩ, kwɛn ŋɛn yɛ amaakwa. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Kal ngɔ-mwiĩ bvool wɛɛl eluɔ bvi esiil onse yɛ bvi eyii esɔɔ okwa. Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ mwɛn kwɛn ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ yɛ k'ɛ̃li ɔ̃koo ke mviil ã Nziã a mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Oŋɔ̃ yeel ãtee m'eyɔɔ yɛ y'emfa ki eyoo yɛ mɔ̃. Kwɛɛ mɔ̃, bvool kaal ɔ̃kwal a yɛ! Okɛɛn yɛ ke kal ngɔ-mwiĩ wɛ, mɛ̃ èya ola yɛ onge b'eya mbuul a pfuul: Yɛ k'àyɛɛ bam lio li èpal mɛ̃ ola yɛ enseel wɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Kɛn ola yɛ ke Saades, eli ye baal ke kwɛ bɛn k'abiil ekɔ e bɔ wɛ. Bɔ akieel adzuu ye mɛ̃ m'ekɔ bvi afuu-fuu, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ abvaan me ndɔɔ oyɔ. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />M'emfa okyɛ, wu akieel abvel mpɛn, akieel alaal ndɛ ekɔ bvi afuu-fuu. Mɛ̃ ndyam kieel k'edzeel nkuũ a ndɛ onse ɔ̃nkaan wu elaã wɛ. Mɛ̃ ekieel ekiool ke nkwel a Tal a mɛ̃ y'ãnzwel ã ndɛ wɛn ndɛ oli wa mɛ̃.<verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Yɔɔl kwɛn wa y'ãtswi, ayoo m'eyɛɛn Ɔ̃fel ãbvɔɔn!”»<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nkaan wu ayuɔɔl ebvɔɔn li bviil li Filadelefi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />«Kel ãnzwel m'ebvɔɔn li bviil li Filadelefi ɔ̃nkaan bubu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:7">“Yoo m'eyɛɛn mbuul wu Ɔ̃nsensal, wa Taa-taa. Ndɛ osiin ɔ̃wɔɔl wu ɔ̃kwɛn David: Ndɛ adzweel, mbuul k'akoo m'okuru wɛ, ndɛ akuru, mbuul k'akoo m'odzweel wɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ yɛ. Tal, mɛ̃ nsuul edzoo kal ke nkwel a yɛ, kyɛn mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'akoo m'okuru wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ yɛ k'eli ye mpɛn bibi wɛ, kɛn a yɛ kwee Endɔɔ e mɛ̃, yɛ ke twɛn wɛ wɛn yɛ ke yɛɛ mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Yoo, mɛ̃ èwa yɛ nkel a baal a Satana, b'abeyɛɛn ndiri bɔ ali Ayuda, kwɛn ŋɛn bɔ k'ali bɔ wɛ, bɔ abepfuru. Tal, mɛ̃ èsa kwɛn bɔ àyebva ãbuo ke nkwel a yɛ, bvool ayɛɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ ndyam edzii yɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Onge bɛn yɛ akwee Endɔɔ e mɛ̃ li etam k'akal y'osɛ-mwiĩ, myam hɛ̃ èkiaal yɛ ŋ'ekieel eya lio li fool m'ɔ̃kiri wueel, me ndɔɔ yi akie ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ baal a nsie. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Mɛ̃ ŋ'esa eya. Sɛn ãnã onse m'eli a yɛ, kwɛn mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ abee ekɔrɔ e yɛ ki abewa wu obvel mpɛn owal. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Wu akieel abvel mpɛn, mɛ̃ èsa kwɛn ndɛ akal kwii onse Nzɔ a Nziã a mɛ̃, ndɛ kieel k'apal onse yɔ bam wɛ. Mɛ̃ èkel nkuũ a Nziã a mɛ̃ ye yi bviil e Nziã a mɛ̃ nkal a ndɛ. Bviil olɔ, eli Yelusalem wu alili, wu ofi ywel ola Nziã a mɛ̃. Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ èkel nkuũ a mɛ̃ yi enyiɔɔn nkal a ndɛ.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Yɔɔl kwɛn wa y'ãtswi, ayoo m'eyɛɛn Ɔ̃fel ãbvɔɔn!”»<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nkaan wu akel ebvɔɔn li bviil li Lahodise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />«Kel ãnzwel m'Ebvɔɔn li bviil li Lahodise ɔ̃nkaan bubu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:14">“Yoo m'eyɛɛn wu oli <char style="em">Amɛn</char>, ɔ̃tsweel wa dzu bvool wa ngwanyã, ndɛ wu obɛɛn o bvieel bvi ési Nziã. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ yɛ. Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ ngesɛ wɛn yɛ ke li mfyɛ wɛ, ke li hɛ̃ ye mbaa wɛ. Yɛ kɛn akaakal ye mfyɛ wuo ye mbaa. <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Kɛn onge bɛn yɛ ke li ye mfyɛ wɛ, ke li hɛ̃ ye mbaa wɛ, mɛ̃ èloo yɛ m'ɔ̃nywã a mɛ̃. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Yɛ atɔ m'oyɛɛn wɛn: Mɛ̃ ndi ɔ̃pfel, mɛ̃ ngyii y'obɔɔ bam, mɛ̃ ke ndi y'ekɔɔ li eluɔ kyam wɛ. Kwɛn ŋɛn yɛ adzɛɛn wɛn, yɛ nga-fool li, nga-ãwua li, ɔ̃ywal li, ɔ̃nkwa-mviil li, bvool odzuũ li. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ ngwi yɛ luo li: Suun ɔɔl li emeesuul mbaa tsɛtsɛ ola mɛ̃, kwɛn yɛ kal ɔ̃pfel. Suun ekɔ bvi afuu-fuu, me ndɔɔ yi alaal bvɛ, kwɛn opfuru b'odzuũ o yɛ obee omɔɔn. Suun ɔ̃kyam wu aboo mviil, kwɛn yɛ mwɛn. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Bueel be nzii mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ebewa bɔ mbyel, bvool ebeseel bɔ nkuul. Obobɔ, kal y'ɔ̃tio wu ɔ̃sal, bvool kaal ɔ̃kwal. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Eyoo: Mɛ̃ ntɛɛn k'edzoo bvool ebebɛɛl kyɛ: Ŋɛn mbuul oyoo nkii a mɛ̃, odzweel nzɔ, mɛ̃ èsam ola ndɛ, èdza ye ndɛ, ndɛ àdza ye mɛ̃. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Wu akieel abvel mpɛn, mɛ̃ èmviaal ndɛ nsɛn ye mɛ̃ nkal a kiri e mɛ̃ li okwɛn, onge b'ébvel mɛ̃ bvool ébvi nsɛn ye Tal a mɛ̃ nkal a kiri e ndɛ li okwɛn.<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Yɔɔl kwɛn wa y'ãtswi, ayoo m'eyɛɛn Ɔ̃fel ãbvɔɔn!”»<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kiri li okwɛn e Nziã y'ãbuɛɛn mã ywel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, mɛ̃ mwɛn edzoo ngemɔ̃ kal ke ywel. Nkii yi éyoo mɛ̃ tsɔɔn onge nkii a mvel-a-mvel elieel mɛ̃ bubu: «Nɔɔn kwɛn, mɛ̃ èsuo yɛ m'ã̀ya ke nkwel.» <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Alili oŋɔ̃, Ɔ̃fel osiin mɛ̃. Mɛ̃ bu mwɛn kiri li okwɛn ngelemɔ̃ éli ke ywel. Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ áli me nsɛn nkal a lɔ. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Mbuul wu áli me nsɛn ákengal onge nkɔɔn yi ɔ̃bvɛn yi ata me Dzasepe ye yi ata me Saadwane. Ɔ̃nkaan-wu-abal wu ákengal onge nkɔɔn yi ɔ̃bvɛn yi ata m'Emelode ádzii kiri olɔ. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Ãkiri m'okwɛn ãku-mbuaal y'ãnã (24) ã́dzii kiri li okwɛn olɔ. Nkal ãkiri omɔ̃, ekukwel ãku-mbuaal y'enã (24) éli me nsɛn. Bvɛ élaal ekɔ bvi afuu-fuu. Nkal ɛ̃tswɛ ɛ̃ bvɛ, bvɛ élaal ekɔrɔ bvi ɔɔl. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Ɛ̃bɛɛn ɛ̃ mvel, ye nkyal, y'osiaan b'anzyel ékepal onse kiri li okwɛn olɔ. Ke nkwel a kiri li okwɛn olɔ, éli y'ambunda nsiaan b'akaan kokɔ. Ambunda obɔ, eli ɛ̃fel nsiaan ɛ̃ Nziã. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Ke nkwel a kiri li okwɛn olɔ, éli y'eluɔ kyɛn onge ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa mã tsɛɛn onge bvɛɛl li kal-a-kal lɛn onge nkɔɔn yi ɔ̃bvɛn yi ata me Kilisital. Onse mwiĩ a kiri li okwɛn bvool ngwel-a-ngwel a lɔ, éli y'eluɔ bvi mwiĩ enã bvi eluul me mviil nkwel ye mbee. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Eluɔ ki mwiĩ ki ɛ̃kwel éli k'emfa onge ebob, ki bviaal k'emfa onge muaan-gwɛmbɛ, ki etyel éli y'osu k'emfa onge mbuul, eluɔ ki enã eli onge ɔ̃lyel wu apɔɔn. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Eluɔ enge-enã bvi mwiĩ éli ngemɔ̃-ngemɔ̃ m'ãpab ãsɛɛn. Bvɛ éluul me mviil ngwel-a-ngwel bvool onse mwiĩ. Tsia mwiĩ, bvɛ ékeyɛɛn kɛn oyɛɛn ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">«Ɔ̃nsensal, Ɔ̃nsensal, Ɔ̃nsensal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">eli Mfam Nziã, Nziã-Nga-Waan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">wu áli, wu oli, bvool wu aya!»<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Bvɛ ékeyam me ndɔɔ a lweel e wu áli me nsɛn nkal a kiri li okwɛn, wu oli mwiĩ ɔ̃bu. Bvɛ ékelweel ndɛ, ékewa ndɛ dzuun bvool ékebveel ndɛ ãtuɛɛn. <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />Me lio alili, ekukwel enge-ãku-mbuaal y'enã (24) ékebva ãbuo ke nkwel a wu áli me nsɛn nkal a kiri li okwɛn, alweel ndɛ wu oli mwiĩ ãlio mbueel, atyal ekɔrɔ e bɔ ke nkwel a kiri li okwɛn, ndiri:<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />«Mfam Nziã a bee, yɛ bvaan kwɛn awa yɛ lweel ye dzuun, ye waan!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">Ke ngwel wɛ, yɛ wu ási bvieel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">yɛ ádzii kwɛn bvɛ ekal, bvool ási bvɛ.»<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nkaan wu atsɔɔn ãbwel bwɛn a Muaan a emɛmɛɛ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Mɛ̃ mwɛn ɔ̃nkaan onse kuɔɔl ki elam e wu áli me nsɛn nkal a kiri li okwɛn. Ɔ̃nkaan ondɛ ákel onse mwiĩ y'onkwel-a-nzi, bvool átsɔɔn ndɛ ãbwel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bwel olɔ, m'ɔ̃nywã wa Ngelek, eli eliĩ ki ákesa m'ɔ̃bwɛɛ wuo me ndiĩ. Mfam nga-eluɔ ákedzɛɛl kyɛ nkal eluɔ e ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi asuo kwɛn kyɛ ki ndɛ. Ákedzɛɛl kyɛ hɛ̃ m'okuru b'ɔ̃nkaan wu afuru m'ofuru.</char></note> nsiaan. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Mɛ̃ mwɛn hɛ̃ ãnzwel ngãmɔ̃ mã ye waan m'ã́kebiool me nkii yi kokɔ ndiri: «Wu obvaan m'onyiɔɔn b'ãbwel y'odzweel b'ɔ̃nkaan nã?» <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Kɛn a mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃, ekal ke ywel, ekal me nsie, ekal ke nsɛn a nsie, k'akoo k'adzweel ɔ̃nkaan wɛ, onkyam k'atal ndɛ. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Mɛ̃ bu bvi olel bibi, me ndɔɔ yɛn mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ wu ábvaan m'odzweel o ndɛ, onkyam m'otal o ndɛ, k'adzuul wɛ. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃ onse ekukwel olieel mɛ̃ bubu: «Bee olel. Tal, eli ye wu obvel mpɛn. Ndɛ ondɛ ebob ki yam li Yuda, wa yam li ɔ̃kwɛn David. Ndɛ wu obvaan m'onyiɔɔn b'ãbwel ãnge-nsiaan y'odzweel b'ɔ̃nkaan.» <verse eid="REV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Mɛ̃ bu mwɛn muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ tɛ, kal-a-kal a kiri li okwɛn. Eluɔ bvi mwiĩ enge-enã y'ekukwel edzii ndɛ. Ndɛ áli onge wu áwi kab. Ndɛ áli y'ãnsiɛɛn nsiaan, ye mviil hɛ̃ nsiaan, m'ãli ɛ̃fel nsiaan mi Nziã mi áyuɔɔl me nsie yueel. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Muaan-Emɛmɛɛ̃ okyɛ oyewal ɔ̃nkaan me kuɔɔl ki elam e wu áli me nsɛn nkal a kiri li okwɛn. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Ŋ'ewel Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ ɔ̃nkaan, eluɔ bvi mwiĩ enge-enã y'ekukwel ãku-mbuaal y'enã (24) ebvi ãbuo ke nkwel a ndɛ. Ngemɔ̃-ngemɔ̃ onse bvɛ esiin nguɔ̃ y'asaan ba me ɔɔl, b'ãluul m'ɔ̃ywiri, wu oli ãbuɛɛn ã ba ngel. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Bvɛ eyam nziĩ yi nyiɔɔn ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">«Yɛ bvaan m'owal b'ɔ̃nkaan, bvool m'onyiɔɔn o ndɛ ãbwel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Ke ngwel wɛ, áwi yɛ onge kab. Obobɔ, yɛ ásuun ãyam mbueel, y'ɛ̃nywã mvieel, ye baal b'ãyam mbueel, y'ɛ̃kiri mvieel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Yɛ ásuun bɔ m'ãkel a yɛ, me ndɔɔ a Nziã. <verse eid="REV 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Yɛ si kwɛn bɔ akal baal b'okwɛn o Nziã, akal angaa-a-Nziã b'asal me ndɔɔ a Nziã a bia-byɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">bvool bɔ akal y'okwɛn nkal ɔ̃kiri.»<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Mɛ̃ ntal, bvool ngyoo nkii a ãnzwel bibi m'ãdzii kiri li okwɛn, ye yi eluɔ bvi mwiĩ, ye yi ekukwel. Ɔ̃bvɛn a bɔ áli amiil bibi. <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Bɔ ákeyam bam kokɔ ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">«Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ wu áwi kab obvaan kwɛn awa ndɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">waan, opfel, ãyal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">mpɛn, dzuun, lweel, y'ãtuɛɛn.»<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Mɛ̃ ngyoo eluɔ bvieel bvi ési Nziã bvi ke ywel, bvi me nsie, bvi ke nsɛn a nsie, bvi nkal ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa ye bvi onse mɔ̃, bvɛ ékeyam bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">«Yɔɔl kwɛn ãtuɛɛn, dzuun, lweel, y'omfam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">ekal ɔ̃bu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">ola wu oli me nsɛn nkal a kiri li okwɛn, bvool ola Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃!»<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Oŋɔ̃ eluɔ bvi mwiĩ enge-enã eyɛɛn ndiri: «Amɛn!» Oŋɔ̃ ekukwel ebvi ãbuo m'obuɛɛn.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s1">Onyiɔɔn b'ãbwel ãsɛɛn m'ɛ̃kwel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, mɛ̃ mwɛn k'enyiɔɔn Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ bwel li ɛ̃kwel onse ãbwel ãnge-nsiaan. Mɛ̃ bu ngyoo eluɔ ki ɛ̃kwel onse eluɔ bvi mwiĩ enge-enã eyɛɛn me nkii yi kokɔ onge nzyel ndiri: «Ya!» <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Mɛ̃ bu mwɛn Swebval wa fuu. Wu ánɔɔn nkal a ndɛ ásiin ndaan. Awi ndɛ ekɔrɔ ki awa wu obvel mpɛn. Ndɛ bu ayɛn me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ obvel mpɛn, bvool me ndɔɔ yi abvel mpɛn bvool.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Ŋ'enyiɔɔn ndɛ bwel li mbuaal, mɛ̃ ngyoo eluɔ ki mwiĩ ki bviaal eyɛɛn ndiri: «Ya!» <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Swebval ɔ̃kyam wa bɛ onge mbaa bu apal. Awi wu ánɔɔn nkal a ndɛ okwɛn b'ambaal opi me nsie, kwɛn baal atiɛɛn bakyɛ ãbwel. Awi ndɛ epwel kyam ki enɛn.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Ŋ'enyiɔɔn ndɛ bwel li ãtyel, mɛ̃ ngyoo eluɔ ki mwiĩ ki etyel eyɛɛn ndiri: «Ya!» Mɛ̃ bu mwɛn swebval wa pi. Wu ánɔɔn nkal a ndɛ ásiin eluɔ ki akie olyam onse kuɔɔl. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Mɛ̃ ngyoo eluɔ kyɛn onge nkii eyɛɛn kal-a-kal eluɔ bvi mwiĩ enge-enã ndiri: «Kilo ngɔmɔ̃ wa bele me ndɔɔ a furu li ɔ̃sal wa tsoo ngelemɔ̃, akilo atyel ba ɔɔdze me ndɔɔ a furu li ɔ̃sal wa tsoo ngelemɔ̃. Me b'otal mbaal ye mbal ã bvine, oyɛɛ ke biil mɔ̃ wɛ.»<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Ŋ'enyiɔɔn ndɛ bwel li ãnã, mɛ̃ ngyoo nkii a eluɔ ki mwiĩ ki enã eyɛɛn ndiri: «Ya!» <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Mɛ̃ bu mwɛn swebval wɛn onge ãdza ã ngakuo. Wu ánɔɔn nkal a ndɛ, nkuun Epfu. Ola o b'ákwi-ákwi ókenɔɔn a ndɛ. Awi bɔ omfam nkal etswi e nsie ngemɔ̃ onse etswi enã bvi ɔ̃kiri a nsie, me ndɔɔ yi abam baal m'epwel, m'ɔ̃lɔɔ, m'ãluu m'ãbi-ãbi, bvool m'anyam a mpuru ba nsie.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Ŋ'enyiɔɔn ndɛ bwel li ãtaan, ke nsɛn a nkiin yi awa Nziã ãkab, mɛ̃ mwɛn ɛ̃fel ɛ̃ b'áwi nsoo me ndɔɔ Endɔɔ e Nziã bvool me ndɔɔ otsweel b'étsweel bɔ. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Bɔ abiool kokɔ ndiri: «Mfam wu ɔ̃nsensal bvool wa taa-taa, yɛ akiaal tiil mpuanki m'otsiil b'ãndɔɔ ã baal a nsie, bvool awa etumbu m'ãkel ã bee m'étsal bɔ?» <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Awi ngɔmɔ̃-ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ ɔ̃nkuru wa fuu, bvool ayɛɛn bɔ ndiri awuun kɛn ãlio ke kwɛ, tiil ye k'ekoo ɔ̃bvɛn a b'ali andoo a bɔ b'ɔ̃sal ye baan-ngoo a bɔ b'akieel abam onge b'ábam bɔ.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Etal me mwɛn mɛ̃ ŋ'enyiɔɔn ndɛ bwel li ãsɛɛn: Nsie enziool yam kokɔ. Tal eyii pii kob onge ekɔ e mpiri, bvool nswii wueel oyii bɛ onge ãkel.<verse eid="REV 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Angam-a-ngam afi ywel ayiool me nsie, onge b'etsuaal ɔ̃ti a fig afig ŋ'enziool mfel wa kokɔ ndɛ.<verse eid="REV 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Ywel edzuru nzuru onge ɔ̃kaan wu afuru m'ofuru, bvool ambaal ãnkio mbueel y'esanga k'ãmboo ã mɔ̃.<verse eid="REV 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Akwɛn b'ɔ̃kiri, baal b'anɛn, ambiri b'ambwel-mbwel, apfel, awaan, baal b'asiil bueel, ankyal wuo baal ba ndii, ayedziɔɔn onse ãywɛn m'onse ãnkɔɔn bvool onse ãnkɔɔn m'ãnɛn m'onse ãnkio. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Bɔ ákeliaal ãnkio y'ãnkɔɔn m'ãnɛn ndiri: «Ebva nkal a bee, ekwɛɛ bee lala ye wu obvi nsɛn nkal a kiri li okwɛn, bvool lala ye mpuru a Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃. <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Ngwanyã, tsoo li nɛn li mpuru a bɔ emeekoo, wɛn ol'otɛɛn ɔ̃kiri nã?»<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Asi baal a Nziã eliĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, mɛ̃ mwɛn ãnzwel ãnã m'ɔ̃kiri k'ɛ̃soo ɛ̃ nsie ɛ̃nge-ɛ̃nã mi ɔ̃kiri a nsie. Mɔ̃ ãkekuru amfel anã b'ɔ̃kiri a nsie, kwɛn mfel si ngɔmɔ̃ abee opob, ekal me nsie, ekal m'ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa, ekal nkal ɔ̃ti onkyam ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Mɛ̃ mwɛn hɛ̃ ãnzwel ngãmɔ̃ ãkyam ã́fi k'etswi ki epal tal, bvool ã́siin eliĩ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eliĩ wuo bwel: Etal 5.1 ye m'akel ke nsɛn.</char></note> e Nziã wa mwiĩ. Mɔ̃ ãbiool me nkii yi kokɔ ol'ãnzwel ãnã m'áwi waan li asa nsie y'ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa obi me nkii, ndiri: <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />«Ebee nsie obi osa, ekal ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa, ekal ɛ̃ti, tiil ye k'esa bia-byɛ eliĩ m'ãmbwii m'asal a Nziã a bia-byɛ.» <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ngyoo ɔ̃bvɛn a baal b'ési ãnzwel eliĩ. Bɔ áli amiil ɔ̃nkam y'ãku-ãnã y'anã (144.000) m'ãyam mbueel m'Afi-Isalayel. <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Baal ba yam li Yuda áli amiil kuun ye buaal (12.000) bɛn ási bɔ eliĩ. Ba yam li Lubɛn áli amiil kuun ye buaal (12.000). Ba yam li Gad áli amiil kuun ye buaal (12.000). <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />Ba yam li Asɛɛl áli amiil kuun ye buaal (12.000). Ba yam li Nefitali áli amiil kuun ye buaal (12.000). Ba yam li Manase áli amiil kuun ye buaal (12.000). <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />Ba yam li Simehɔ̃ áli amiil kuun ye buaal (12.000). Ba yam li Lebvi áli amiil kuun ye buaal (12.000). Ba yam li Isakaal áli amiil kuun ye buaal (12.000). <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />Ba yam li Dzabulɔ̃ áli amiil kuun ye buaal (12.000). Ba yam li Dzedzef áli amiil kuun ye buaal (12.000). Ba yam li Bɛnzamɛ̃ áli amiil kuun ye buaal (12.000). Ási bɔ bueel eliĩ.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Embuul kyɛn k'akoo k'atsiɔ wɛ ke nkwel a kiri li okwɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Ke mbee a ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, mɛ̃ mwɛn embuul e baal ki kokɔ kyɛn mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'akoo m'otsiɔ wɛ. Éli embuul ki ɔ̃kiri wueel, ki ãyam ã baal mbueel, ki ãsel mbueel, ye ki ɛ̃nywã mvieel. Bɔ áli ke nkwel a kiri li okwɛn bvool ke nkwel a Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃. Bɔ álaal ɛ̃nkuru mi afuu-fuu, ásiin nsuɛɛn yi ãba me mviɔɔl. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Bɔ ákebiool kokɔ ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">«Obvuul oli me Nziã a bia-byɛ wu bvi nsɛn nkal a kiri li okwɛn, bvool me Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃!»<verse eid="REV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Ãnzwel mbueel ã́dzii kiri li okwɛn, y'ekukwel y'eluɔ bvi mwiĩ enge-enã. Bɔ abvi ãbuo mbwii me nsie ke nkwel a kiri li okwɛn, ãlweel Nziã. <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />Bɔ ayɛɛn bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">«Amɛn! Yɔɔl kwɛn ãtuɛɛn, lweel, ãyal, obveel b'ãtuɛɛn, dzuun, waan, ye mpɛn, ekal bvi Nziã a bia-byɛ ɔ̃bu! Amɛn!»<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Obobɔ, ngɔmɔ̃ onse ekukwel ofuul mɛ̃ ndiri: «Baal b'alaal ɛ̃nkuru mi afuu-fuu ba, anã ali? Bɔ kwɛn afi?» <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Mɛ̃ mveel ndɛ wɛn: «Mfam a mɛ̃, yam mbuul wu yɛɛ!» Ndɛ bu alieel mɛ̃ ndiri: «Eli baal b'apal onse fool li bibi. Bɔ asuɔɔl ɛ̃nkuru ɛ̃ bɔ, asuul myɛ̃ eyii fuu m'ãkel ã Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Obɔ otsɛn b'eli bɔ ke nkwel a kiri li okwɛn e Nziã, me ndɔɔ yi asal me ndɔɔ a ndɛ tsia mwiĩ, onse Nzɔ a ndɛ. Wu oli me nsɛn nkal a kiri li okwɛn akieel akwɛɛ bɔ onse Nzɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Bɔ kieel k'ayoo nzal bvool wɛ, k'ayoo nzuaal bvool wɛ. Obal o mwiĩ y'otsuru o mbaa kieel k'obetuaal bɔ fool bvool wɛ. <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ wu oli kal-a-kal a kiri li okwɛn akieel akal ɔ̃mbuaal a bɔ, bvool abiri bɔ k'ɛ̃tswɛ mi amvieel b'elaã, bvool Nziã akieel akiɔɔn ãnsia mbueel me mviil ã bɔ.»<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s1">Onyiɔɔn o bwel li nsiaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Ŋ'enyiɔɔn Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ bwel li nsiaan, ɔ̃lii obvi ke ywel wu osi ab'etswel e lio. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Mɛ̃ mwɛn ãnzwel nsiaan m'ãbetɛɛn ke nkwel a Nziã. Awi mɔ̃ amvel-a-mvel nsiaan. <verse eid="REV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Ãnzwel ngãmɔ̃ ãkyam ãyetɛɛn ke nkiin yi atsoo ɔ̃ywiri. Mɔ̃ ã́siin saan li ɔɔl li abetsoo ɔ̃ywiri. Awi ãnzwel omɔ̃ ɛ̃ywiri bibi, kwɛn mɔ̃ ãwa myɛ̃ kab y'ãbuɛɛn ã ba ngel nkal a nkiin ã kab yi ɔɔl, ke nkwel a kiri li okwɛn. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Yoo li ɔ̃ywiri eyɛn ywel ke nkwel a Nziã fa kuɔɔl ki ãnzwel. Ãbuɛɛn ã ba ngel ãyɛn ywel hɛ̃. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Ãnzwel ãwel saan li atsoo ɔ̃ywiri olɔ, bu ãluul lɔ m'ãkal ã mbaa m'ãli nkal a nkiin a ãkab. Mɔ̃ ãtyel lɔ me nsie. Anzyel asiaan, ayoo nkyal, amvel abɛɛn, bvool nsie enziool nzuru.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obel b'amvel-a-mvel asɛɛn b'ɛ̃kwel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Obobɔ, ãnzwel ãnge-nsiaan m'ã́siin amvel-a-mvel ãwel ɔ̃yɛɛl, me ndɔɔ yi afel bɔ.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Ãnzwel m'ɛ̃kwel ãfel mvel-a-mvel. Mvel a ãkyal ye mbaa bvoo y'ãkel oyiool me nsie. Etswi e nsie ki etyel edzio mbaa esii kal, etswi ki etyel ki ɛ̃ti edzio mbaa esii kal, bvool bviĩ bvieel bvi ebee hɛ̃ edzio mbaa esii kal.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Ãnzwel mã mbuaal ãfel mvel-a-mvel. Eluɔ kyɛn onge nkio yi enɛn yi ekedzio mbaa eyeyiool onse ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa. Etswi ki etyel ki ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa ekɔɔl ãkel. <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />Boo li atyel li eluɔ bvi ési Nziã, bvi eli onse ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa, bvi éli y'ɔ̃fiaal, ekwii, bvool epie ki etyel ki ãswa eyɛn-nkel.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Ãnzwel m'ãtyel ãfel mvel-a-mvel. Ngam-a-ngam wu ɔ̃nɛn ofi ywel obvi, ndɛ akekaan mbaa onge mbunda. Ndɛ obvi nkal etswi ki etyel ki ãnzal ye ki ɛ̃tswɛ mi amvieel. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Nkuũ a ngam-a-ngam ondɛ Abisinte<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abisinte </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri «nkaa».</char></note>. Etswi ki etyel ki ãdza eyii ye nkaa. Baal bibi bu akwi me ndɔɔ a ãdza ã nkaa omɔ̃.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Ãnzwel m'ãnã ãfel mvel-a-mvel. Epie e tal ki etyel, ye ki nswii, ye ki angam-a-ngam ebii, m'emfa kyɛn epie e bvɛ bvi etyel ekɔɔl empeel. M'epie ki etyel ki mwiĩ, tal k'ebengal wɛ. M'epie ki etyel ki tsia hɛ̃, nswii k'abengal wɛ.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Mɛ̃ bvool ntal, bu ngyoo ɔ̃lyel ngɔmɔ̃ wu ákepɔɔn nkal ɔ̃ntɛ. Ndɛ ákeyɛɛn me nkii yi kokɔ ndiri: «Fool, fool, fool me baal a nsie, ŋ'èbel amvel-a-mvel ange-atyel b'efel ãnzwel ãnge-ãtyel m'ãsiil!»<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Ãnzwel m'ãtaan ãfel mvel-a-mvel. Mɛ̃ mwɛn ngam-a-ngam wu áfi ywel ábvi me nsie. Awi ngam-a-ngam ondɛ ɔ̃wɔɔl a ywɛn li ela li ke nsɛn a nsie. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Ndɛ odzweel ywɛn li ela li ke nsɛn a nsie. Yoo lɛn onge li bvuun e mbaa li nɛn epal onse ywɛn olɔ. Tal epiin y'ɔ̃piɛɛl a mfel me yoo li epal onse ywɛn olɔ. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Ansɛnsɛ apal onse yoo olɔ bu atsɔɔn me nsie. Awi bɔ waan lɛn onge li angiɛ̃-miin. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Aluo bɔ k'asa bviĩ bvi ɔ̃kiri y'ɛ̃ti obi, ekal mi enɛn, ekal mi ɛ̃tsi-ɛ̃tsi. Awi bɔ nkuul yi asa obi kɛn me baal bɛn k'ali y'eliĩ e Nziã m'ãmbwii wɛ. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Awi bɔ waan li atuaal baal mpal nswii taan, ke waan li abam bɔ wɛ. Mpal yi éketuaal bɔ baal éli onge mpal yi emwɛn mbuul wu etswi ngiɛ̃-miin. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />M'ãtsoo omɔ̃, baal akieel abii epfu, kɛn a bɔ kieel k'abɔɔ lɔ wɛ. Bɔ akieel adzii k'akwa, kɛn epfu ekieel ebal bɔ.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Ansɛnsɛ obɔ áli k'emfa onge aswebval b'ayɛɛl me ndɔɔ a mvel. Nkal ɛ̃tswɛ ɛ̃ bɔ, éli y'eluɔ bvɛn onge ekɔrɔ bvi me ɔɔl, ãsu ã bɔ ã́li onge mã baal. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Mfu e bɔ éfɛɛn onge yi akaal, bvool miin ã bɔ ã́li k'emfa onge m'ebob. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Ãtwel ã bɔ áli onge mã baal b'alaal ɛ̃kuru ɛ̃ mvel mi ãbvieel, bvool nkyal yi ãpab ã bɔ éli onge yi aswaal b'edzuru aswebval bibi b'atsuu ntiin k'ayi mvel. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Ɛ̃kel ɛ̃ bɔ ɛ̃li y'ãnsiɛɛn onge mi angiɛ̃-miin. Waan e bɔ li asa baal obi mvel taan, éli onse ɛ̃kel ɛ̃ bɔ. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Mfam wu áli nkal a bɔ éli ãnzwel ã ywɛn li ela li ke nsɛn a nsie, m'ata m'Abadon m'ɔ̃nywã wu Ayuda. Ata mɔ̃ hɛ̃ m'Apolyon, m'ɔ̃nywã wa Ngelek, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri: «Ɔ̃biil».<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Fool li ɛ̃kwel ebwel. Tal, ãndɔɔ mbuual mã fool bvool ãyeya ke nkwel.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Ãnzwel m'ãsɛɛn ãfel mvel-a-mvel. Mɛ̃ bu ngyoo nkii ngamɔ̃ efi k'ɛ̃soo ɛ̃nã mi nkiin yi awa Nziã ãkab yi ɔɔl, yi eli ke nkwel a Nziã. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Nkii oyɔ ékeyɛɛn ãnzwel m'ãsɛɛn m'ã́li ye mvel-a-mvel ndiri: «Nyiɔɔn ãnzwel ãnã m'akuru ɛ̃sii ke nzal yi nɛn yi ata m'Efalate.» <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Obobɔ, anyiɔɔn ãnzwel ãnge-ãnã. Áyɛɛl mɔ̃ me ndɔɔ a lio lili olɔ, tsoo lili olɔ, nswii wuwu ondɛ ye mvel wuwu ondɛ, me ndɔɔ yi abam boo li ãtyel li ɔ̃bvɛn a baal. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Ɔ̃bvɛn a baal b'adzwaan m'aswebval áli wu amiliɔ̃ ɛ̃nkam mviaal (200.000.000), ondɛ ɔ̃bvɛn wu álieel mɛ̃.<verse eid="REV 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Tal emfa kyɛn onse emwɛn e mɛ̃, mɛ̃ mwɛn aswebval ye b'ánɔɔn nkal a bɔ. Bɔ áli y'ɛ̃kuru ɛ̃ mvel mi ãbvieel mi abelaal m'otwel mi bɛ onge mbaa, ye mi bule onge nkɔɔn yi ɔ̃bvɛn yi Safiil, bvool mbaal-mbaal ong'ɔ̃fel wu ata me sofolo. Ɛ̃tswɛ mi aswebval eli onge mi ebob. Ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃ bɔ ɛ̃kepaal mbaa, ye yoo, y'ɔ̃fel wu ata me sofolo. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Eywiri obvɛ ebam boo li ãtyel li baal. Eywiri obvɛ éli bvi: mbaa, ye yoo, y'ɔ̃fel wu ata me sofolo. Bvɛ ekepal onse ɛ̃nywã mi asweval obɔ. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Ke ngwel wɛ, waan li aswebval éli onse ɛ̃nywã y'ɛ̃kel ɛ̃ bɔ. Ɛ̃kel ɛ̃ bɔ ɛ̃́li k'emfa onge antaal. Bɔ áli y'ɛ̃tswɛ, bvool bɔ ákesa baal obi m'ɛ̃tswɛ omyɛ̃.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Baal b'asiil bɛn eywiri obvɛ k'ébam wɛ, k'atiɔ etiɔ bvi ési bɔ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ bam eboo wɛ. Bɔ k'ayɔɔl k'alweel ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi, y'etiɔ bvi me ɔɔl, bvi me bvieel li aadzã, bvi me bvieel li bolonze ye bvi m'ɛ̃ti, wɛ. Kwɛn ŋɛn etiɔ obvɛ k'ekoo m'omwɛn wɛ, m'oyoo wɛ, m'odzuu hɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Bɔ k'ayɔɔl obam o baal wɛ, k'ayɔɔl ebel wɛ, k'ayɔɔl ãndɔɔ m'esio wɛ, k'ayɔɔl pfuul hɛ̃ wɛ.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ãnzwel ye muaan-ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, mɛ̃ mwɛn ãnzwel ãkyam mã ye waan m'ãfi ywel. Epɛn édzii mɔ̃, ɔ̃nkaan-wu-abaa áli nkal ɔ̃tswɛ a ndɛ. Osu o mɔ̃ óli onge tal, ɛ̃mpal ɛ̃ mɔ̃ onge ãkwii ã mbaa. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Mɔ̃ ã́kesiin muaan-ɔ̃nkaan wu áli kal me kuɔɔl. Mɔ̃ ãndɔɔl kuul ki elam nkal ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa, ki ekal nkal a nsie. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Mɔ̃ bu ãbvi obiool onge b'eta ebob ɛ̃baan. Mɔ̃ ãbiool, oŋɔ̃ anzyel nsiaan asiaan. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Ŋ'esiaan anzyel ange-nsiaan, mɛ̃ boombii k'eswɛn m'eyɛɛn bɔ, kɛn a mɛ̃ ngyoo nkii ngamɔ̃ fa ywel elieel mɛ̃ ndiri: «Suul ãndɔɔ m'eyɛɛn anzyel ange-nsiaan ãkal m'edziɔɔn, oyɛɛ ke swɛn mɔ̃ wɛ.»<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Obobɔ, ãnzwel m'emwɛn mɛ̃ tɛ nkal ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa bvool nkal a nsie ãndɛɛl kuɔɔl ki elam ke ywel. <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />Mɔ̃ bu ãlab ɔ̃kyel me nkuũ a wu eli y'elaã ɔ̃bu, wu ási ywel ye bvi eli ke lɔ, nsie ye bvi eli me yɔ, ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa ye bvi eli onse mɔ̃. Mɔ̃ ãlieel bubu: «Meba, lio li akiaal k'ebekal wɛ! <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Kɛn a m'ãtsoo m'èfel ãnzwel mã nsiaan mvel-a-mvel, Nziã àsa ɔ̃yɛɛl a ndɛ wa m'edziɔɔn. Ɔ̃yɛɛl ondɛ oli m'emfa ki Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi élieel ndɛ asal a ndɛ b'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã.»<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Nkii yi éyoo mɛ̃ éfi ywel eyɛɛn ye mɛ̃ bvool. Yɔ elieel mɛ̃ bubu: «Yi y'awal muaan-ɔ̃nkaan wu oli kal me kuɔɔl ki ãnzwel m'ãli tɛ nkal ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa bvool nkal a nsie.»<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛn ol'ãnzwel, bu ngyɛɛn mɔ̃ ndiri ãwa mɛ̃ muaan-ɔ̃nkaan. Mɔ̃ alieel mɛ̃ ndiri: «Wal ndɛ, bvool mɛn ndɛ. Ndɛ akieel aluul ɔ̃la a yɛ me nkaa, kɛn onse ɔ̃nywã a yɛ, ndɛ akieel akal y'opɛɛn onge mbaal ã nzoo.»<verse eid="REV 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Mɛ̃ ngwel muaan-ɔ̃nkaan me kuɔɔl ki ãnzwel, bu mɛn ndɛ. Onse ɔ̃nywã a mɛ̃, ndɛ áli y'opɛɛn onge mbaal ã nzoo, kɛn a ŋe mɛn mɛ̃ ndɛ, ɔ̃la a mɛ̃ oluul me nkaa.<verse eid="REV 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Obobɔ, alieel mɛ̃ ndiri: «Ebvaan kwɛn yɛ bvool ayɛɛn ãndɔɔ m'ãfi ola Nziã m'ãyam bibi, m'ɛ̃kiri bibi, m'ɛ̃nywã bibi, m'akwɛn bibi.»<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Amwɛn buaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Awi mɛ̃ ɔ̃mbɛɛl wɛn onge ɔ̃mpaã, bu alieel mɛ̃ ndiri: «Tɛɛn, bvool wal emvɛɛl e mboo a Nziã yi ɔ̃nsensal, li nkiin yi awa Nziã ãkab, bvool tsiɔ ɔ̃bvɛn a b'alweel Nziã onse mboo oyɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Kɛn a yɛ k'àwal emvɛɛl e nkwel-a-nzi a mboo yi ɔ̃nsensal yi onse Nzɔ a Nziã wɛ, yɔɔl yɔ, ke ngwel wɛ áwi yɔ bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ. Bɔ akieel anyam bviil li ngel nswii ãku-ãnã ye yuaal (42). <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Mɛ̃ ekieel ewa amwɛn a mɛ̃ buaal waan li ayɛɛn ãndɔɔ m'ãfa ola Nziã. Bɔ akieel alaal ekɔ e mpiri ãtsoo miil ngɔmɔ̃ y'ɛ̃nkam mviaal y'ãku-ãsɛɛn (1.260).»<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Amwɛn ange-buaal ali ɛ̃ti mi olibve mviaal y'eluɔ bviaal bvi abendɔɔl ambunda bvi etɛɛn ke nkwel a Mfam a nsie. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Ŋɛn mbuul odzii k'asa bɔ obi, mbaa epal onse ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃ bɔ, bvool edziool ataal a bɔ. Ngwanyã, wu odzii k'asa bɔ obi, ebvaan abam ndɛ m'emfa okyɛ. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Bɔ ali ye waan li akuru ywel, kwɛn mvel abee ondwɔɔ, me lio li esa bɔ ɔ̃sal a bɔ wu eliaal bɔ ãndɔɔ m'ãfa ola Nziã. Bɔ hɛ̃ ali ye waan li asa kwɛn ãdza ãkɔɔl ãkel, bvool li ayuɔɔl eywiri bvi emfa bvieel me nsie, me lio lueel li edzii bɔ.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Ŋ'ekieel eman bɔ k'aliaal ãndɔɔ m'ãfa ola Nziã, nyam a mpuru wu apal onse ywɛn li ela li ke nsɛn a nsie akieel adzɔɔ bɔ eta, abvel bɔ mpɛn, bvool abam bɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Ebiĩ e bɔ ekieel ekal ke bal-bal a bviil wu ɔ̃nɛn m'emfa ki bviil li Sodome y'ɔ̃kiri wu Edzipito. Oyɔ mboo yi ábɛɛl Mfam a bɔ m'enkulusu. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Baal b'ãsel mbueel, b'ɛ̃nywã mvieel, b'ãyam mbueel, ye b'ɛ̃kiri mvieel, akieel amwɛn ebiĩ e bɔ ãtsoo ãtyel y'etswel, bvool kieel k'awa nkuul yi alɔ ebiĩ e bɔ onse mpiɛɛn wɛ. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Baal a nsie akieel asia mpaa me ndɔɔ epfu e bɔ, abɛɛl ãpfuun, ayuɔɔl bakyɛ ebva-kab, me ndɔɔ yɛn aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ange-buaal átueel bɔ fool bibi.<verse eid="REV 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Ke mbee ãtsoo ãnge-ãtyel y'etswel, ɔ̃fel ngɔmɔ̃ wu elaã wu ofi ola Nziã osam onse bɔ, bɔ bu atɛɛn tɛ. Ebangɛɛ esiin b'áketal bɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Bɔ ayoo nkii ngamɔ̃ yi kokɔ fa ywel eyii eyɛɛn ye bɔ ndiri: «Ewuaal ywel kwɛn!» Bɔ awueel ywel onse epɛn, ataal a bɔ amwɛn bɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Me lio olɔ, nsie enziool nzuru yam bibi, etswi e bviil ki kuun ebool. Baal amiil nsiaan (7.000) akwi m'onziool o nsie obɔ. Bakyɛ ongɛɛ obɔɔ, bvool alweel Nziã wa ke ywel.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Ndɔɔ yi fool yi mbuaal ebwel, kɛn a yi ãtyel ŋ'esa eya.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvel-a-mvel wa nsiaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ãnzwel mã nsiaan ãfel mvel-a-mvel. Ãnkii m'ãnɛn ãbel ke ywel. Mɔ̃ ã́keyɛɛn bubu: «Ompu b'ɔ̃kiri oyii bo Mfam a bia-byɛ ye Mãsia a ndɛ. Ompu ba okieel okal ɔ̃bu!» <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Akuul-kuul ãku-mbuaal y'anã (24) b'áli me nsɛn nkal ãkiri ã bɔ m'okwɛn abvi ãmbwii me nsie ke nkwel a Nziã, bvool alweel ndɛ. <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />Bɔ ayɛɛn ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">«Bee etuɛɛn yɛ, Mfam Nziã, Nziã-Nga-Waan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">yɛ wu oli bvool áli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Yɛ suo waan e yɛ li nɛn, bu bveel ompu o yɛ.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Ɛ̃kiri ɛ̃bal mpuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">kɛn a mpuru a yɛ eyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">lio li etsiil yɛ ãndɔɔ ã b'ákwi-ákwi eyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">li awa ebva-kab m'asal a yɛ b'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">ye baal ba ngel, ye b'abal nkuũ a yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">b'ebewal baal ngwel ye b'ebewa bɔ dzuun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">olɔ hɛ̃ lio li abiil b'abiil nsie!»<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Nzɔ a Nziã yi eli ke ywel edzweel nzuru, nkab a ondoo o ndɛ bu emɔɔn onse Nzɔ oyɔ. Amvel abɛɛn, ãnkii ãbel, anzyel asiaan, nsie enziool nzuru, mvel a ãkyal wa kokɔ ondwɔɔ.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃kaal ye nyam wɛn nkuũ Dalagɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, eliĩ ngemɔ̃ ki enɛn epal ke ywel: Éli ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃. Ndɛ álaal tal, nswii áli ke nsɛn a ntaã e ndɛ, ekɔrɔ ki awa wu obvel mpɛn ki y'angam-a-ngam kuun ye buaal éli nkal ɔ̃tswɛ a ndɛ. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Ɔ̃kaal ondɛ áli ye yam, bvool áketa ɛ̃baan mi mpuru ye fool li aburu.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Eliĩ ekyam epal ke ywel: Éli nyam wu ata me dalagɔ̃ wu áli wu ɔ̃nɛn, bvool áli bɛ onge mbaa. Ndɛ áli m'ɛ̃tswɛ nsiaan y'ãnsiɛɛn kuun. Ɔ̃tswɛ bwɛn ɔ̃tswɛ álaal ekɔrɔ ki awa wu obvel mpɛn. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Ɔ̃kel a dalagɔ̃ ondɛ ákekuɔɔn boo ngemɔ onse ãboo ãtyel m'ɔ̃bvɛn wu angam-a-ngam ba ywel, bvool átyel bɔ me nsie. Dalagɔ̃ oyebva edzel ke nkwel ɔ̃kaal wu al'oyii asɔɔ oburu, me ndɔɔ yi awool ndɛ muaan a kɛn a ŋ'eburu ndɛ ndɛ oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Ɔ̃kaal ondɛ oburu muaan wu bɔɔl, wu akieel abiri ɛ̃kiri mvieel ye nkoo yueel. Kɛn andɛɛl ndɛ ywel ola Nziã ke kiri e ndɛ li okwɛn. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Me b'otal ɔ̃kaal ondɛ, ndɛ obal onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ. Okɔ, Nziã áfaal ndɛ mboo yi aliil ndɛ ãtsoo miil ngɔmɔ̃ y'ɛ̃nkam mviaal y'ãku-ãsɛɛn (1.260).<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Mvel bu ebvi ke ywel: Miswel y'ãnzwel ã ndɛ ãdzwaan ye dalagɔ̃. Dalagɔ hɛ̃ y'ãnzwel mã ndɛ adzwaan ye bɔ. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Kɛn a dalagɔ̃ k'abvel mpɛn wɛ, obobɔ ndɛ ye nkel a ndɛ k'abekal ye mboo ke ywel wɛ. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Atsueel dalagɔ̃ wu ɔ̃nɛn me nsie. Ndɛ ondɛ ntaal wa tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn, wu ata m'ɔ̃pfu bvool me Satana, wu abepfuru baal b'ɔ̃kiri a nsie bueel. Atsueel ndɛ me nsie, atsueel ãnzwel ã ndɛ hɛ̃ ye ndɛ.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Mɛ̃ bu ngyoo nkii ngamɔ̃ yi kokɔ ke ywel yi ékeyɛɛn ndiri: «Meba ŋã, lio ekoo me ndɔɔ obvuul, waan, ompu o Nziã a bia-byɛ, ye waan e Mãsia a ndɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, wu ákefɛn andoo a bia-byɛ ke nkwel a Nziã, atyel ndɛ onkwel-a-nzi, ndɛ wu ákefɛn bɔ tsia mwiĩ. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Kɛn a bɔ, bɔ abvel ndɛ mpɛn me ndɔɔ ãkel ã Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃, bvool me ndɔɔ otsweel b'etsweel bɔ Endɔɔ e Nziã. Bɔ akiool k'awa omwiĩ o bɔ, k'abal epfu wɛ. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Obobɔ, ywel ye byɛ b'ekal ke lɔ, esia mpaa. Kɛn ãwua mam ola byɛ, nsie y'ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa, ke ngwel wɛ ɔ̃pfu osool ola byɛ afuru fa me mpuru, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ oyɛɛ wɛn esiil ndɛ lio etsi-tsiri!»<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Ŋ'emwɛn dalagɔ̃ kwɛn atsueel ndɛ me nsie, ndɛ obiɔɔn ɔ̃kaal wu áburu muaan wu bɔɔl. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Obobɔ, awi ɔ̃kaal ãpab mbuaal m'ɔ̃lyel wu ɔ̃nɛn, kwɛn ndɛ apɔɔn abal onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ, ke mboo yi àliil ndɛ mvel tyel y'etswel lala ye ntaal. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />M'ɔ̃nywã a ntaal, ndɛ oloo ãdza mɛn onge nzal ke mbee ɔ̃kaal, kwɛn yɔ ebiri ndɛ. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Kɛn a nsie ewueel ɔ̃kaal: Yɔ edzweel ɔ̃nywã, bu emɛn nzal yi éloo dalagɔ̃ m'ɔ̃nywã a ndɛ. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Onge bɛn dalagɔ̃ oyi mpuru y'ɔ̃kaal, ndɛ oyedzwaan ye yam li ɔ̃kaal, ye b'akiaal ãngel ã Nziã bvool b'akuru nzuru m'otaa-taa b'éyiool Yeso.<verse eid="REV 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Ndɛ oyebva edzel hɛ̃ nku-a-nku ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s1">Anyam buaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Mɛ̃ bu mwɛn nyam ngɔmɔ̃ opal onse ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa. Ndɛ áli y'ãnsiɛɛn kuun y'ɛ̃tswɛ nsiaan. Nkal ãnsiɛɛn ã ndɛ, éli y'ekɔrɔ bvi okwɛn kuun. Nkal ɛ̃tswɛ ɛ̃ ndɛ, ákel ãnkuũ m'ãsiaan Nziã. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Nyam wu émwɛn mɛ̃ áli k'emfa onge ngɔ, mviil ɛ̃ ndɛ ɛ̃́li onge nyam a mpuru wu ata me uuse, ɔ̃nywã a ndɛ onge wu ebob. Dalagɔ̃ owi ndɛ waan e ndɛ, ye kiri e ndɛ li okwɛn, y'okwɛn b'onɛn. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Onse ɛ̃tswɛ ɛ̃ ndɛ, ngɔmɔ̃ áli onge wu áli ye bwɔɔ lam li nɛn, kɛn aboo bwɔɔ li ékeebiri ndɛ k'epfu olɔ. Nsie yueel ekam, bu ebvi nyam oluɛɛn. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Baal ákebuɛɛn dalagɔ̃, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ áwi nyam waan. Baal abvi hɛ̃ nyam ondɛ obuɛɛn, y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: «Wu oli onge nyam nã, bvool wu okoo k'adzwaan yɛ ndɛ nã?»<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Awi nyam ɔ̃nywã wu apaal ãyɛɛn m'ondɛɛl o nzuru y'osiaan o Nziã. Awi ndɛ waan li asa ãndɔɔ nswii ãku-ãnã ye yuaal (42). <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Nyam odzweel ɔ̃nywã m'osiaan o Nziã, m'osiaan o nkuũ a ndɛ ye mboo yi ekal ndɛ, bvool m'osiaan o baal bueel b'akal ke ywel. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Awi ndɛ nkuul yi adzwaan ye ba ngel, bvool abvel bɔ mpɛn. Awi ndɛ waan nkal a yam lueel, nkal a baal bueel, nkal ɔ̃nywã wueel, bvool nkal ɔ̃kiri wueel. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Baal b'ɔ̃kiri wueel abvi ndɛ olweel. Baal obɔ bɛn fa k'ési Nziã ɔ̃kiri, ãnkuũ ã bɔ k'ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan wu elaã wa Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ wu ábam wɛ.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Okɛɛn mbuul oli y'ãtswi, yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ ayoo! <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Okɛɛn mbuul obvaan k'ayi bwal, ndɛ àyi bwal. Okɛɛn ebvaan abam mbuul m'epwel, àbam ndɛ m'epwel. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn ba ngel abvaan akal y'osɛ-mwiĩ y'okiool.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Mɛ̃ bu mwɛn nyam ɔ̃kyam opal onse nsie. Ndɛ áli y'ãnsiɛɛn mbuaal mɛn onge mã muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃, bvool ákeyɛɛn onge dalagɔ̃. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Ndɛ ákesuo waan li nyam wu ɛ̃kwel, ke nkwel a nyam ondɛ, bvool ákesa kwɛn nsie ye baal a yɔ abuɛɛn nyam wu ɛ̃kwel ondɛ, wɛn áboo ndɛ bwɔɔ li ékeebiri ndɛ k'epfu. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Nyam wa buaal ondɛ osi emvieel bvi enɛn, tiil k'asa kwɛn mbaa efa ywel esool me nsie, ke mviil ã baal. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />M'emfa okyɛ, ndɛ abepfuru baal a nsie m'emvieel bvi áwi ndɛ nkuul yi asa ke nkwel a nyam wu ɛ̃kwel. Ndɛ atam baal a nsie k'asa etiɔ e nyam wu átɛn m'epwel, kɛn a ndɛ oli kɛn mwiĩ. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Awi nyam wa buaal waan li asa kwɛn etiɔ e nyam wu ɛ̃kwel ekal y'ɔ̃fiaal, kwɛn kyɛ ekoo k'eyɛɛn, bvool ekoo k'ebam bɛn k'adzii k'abuɛɛn ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Nyam wa buaal ondɛ bvool osi kwɛn aywɛɛn baal bueel, ekal akiɔɔl y'akuul, ekal apfel y'aywal, ekal ankyal ye ba ndii, k'akal y'eliĩ e nyam me kuɔɔl ki elam wuo me mbwii. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />M'emfa okyɛ, okɛɛn mbuul k'ali y'eliĩ okyɛ wɛ, ekal ki nkuũ a nyam, ekal ki ɔ̃bvɛn wu oli nsiil ye nkuũ a ndɛ, ndɛ k'akoo m'osuun wuo m'otiɔ b'eluɔ wɛ.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Yi mboo yɛn ebvaan akal y'ɔ̃nyiã. Yɔɔl kwɛn wa y'ãyal, asiɔɔl ɔ̃bvɛn a nyam. Ke ngwel wɛ, ɔ̃bvɛn ondɛ wa baal. Ndɛ oli ɛ̃nkam ɛ̃sɛɛn y'ãku-ãsɛɛn y'asɛɛn (666).<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s1">Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ ye b'ébvuul ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, mɛ̃ mwɛn Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ otɛɛn nkal a nkio yi Siɔ̃. Ndɛ áli ye baal amiil ɔ̃nkam ngɔmɔ̃ y'ãku-ãnã y'anã (144.000), bɛn ákel bɔ nkuũ a ndɛ ye yi Tal nkal ãbwii ã bɔ. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Mɛ̃ ngyoo nkii efi ywel onge nkyal yi etsio ãdza mã bibi, onge nkyal yi osiaan o nzyel bo kokɔ. Esingi ki ngyoo mɛ̃ éli onge ki ãnguɔ̃ ŋ'ekwel baal a sio mɔ̃. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Baal obɔ ayam nziĩ yi enyiɔɔn ke nkwel a kiri li okwɛn, ke nkwel eluɔ bvi mwiĩ enge-enã bvool ke nkwel akuul-kuul. Mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'ákoo k'ayio nziĩ oyɔ wɛ, b'áyio yɔ kɛn a baal amiil ɔ̃nkam ngɔmɔ̃ y'ãku-ãnã y'ãnã (144.000) b'ábvuul me nsie.<verse eid="REV 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Bɔ obɔ bɛn k'abiil nzuru a bɔ m'akaal wɛ, bɔ ali onge ãnsam m'akaal mɛn kɛn ayɛɛ abɔɔl wɛ. Bɔ abeluɛɛn a Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ ãmboo mbueel m'eyi ndɛ. Ábvuul bɔ onse baal, me ndɔɔ yi awa bɔ ola Nziã bvool ola Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ onge kab li ɛ̃kwel. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Bvool onse ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃ bɔ, mfya pyɛ, bɔ hɛ̃ elyal pyɛ.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãnzwel ãtyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Mɛ̃ bvool mwɛn ãnzwel ngãmɔ̃ ãkyam nkal m'ã́kekɛɛn ãntɛ ke ywel. Mɔ̃ áli ye Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu yi atsal ola baal a nsie, ol'ɛ̃kiri mvieel, ol'ãyam mbueel, ol'ɛ̃nywã mvieel, bvool ol'ãsel mbueel. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Mɔ̃ ãkeyɛɛn kokɔ ndiri: «Ebal Nziã, bvool elweel ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ lio li etsiil ndɛ ãndɔɔ emeekoo. Ebuɛɛn ndɛ wu ási ywel, ye nsie, y'ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa, y'ɛ̃tswɛ mi amvieel!»<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Ãnzwel ãkyam ãyi, omɔ̃ mã mbuaal. Mɔ̃ ã́keyɛɛn bubu: «Lɔ ebvi, lɔ ebvi, Bviil li enɛn li Babilon. Lɔ li énzwiil ɛ̃kiri mvieel bvine li mpuru a esio e ndɛ!»<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Ãnzwel ãkyam ãyi, omɔ̃ m'ãtyel. Mɔ̃ ãnɔɔn m'ãnge-mbuaal m'ɛ̃kwel omɔ̃. Mɔ̃ ã́keyɛɛn kokɔ bubu: «Okɛɛn mbuul obuɛɛn nyam y'etiɔ e ndɛ, bvool obɔɔ eliĩ me mbwii wuo me kuɔɔl, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />ndɛ hɛ̃ ànywã mbal ã bvine mã mpuru a Nziã. Mbal omɔ̃ ã̀kal m'ãywɛn a ɔ̃mfee. Àkaal ndɛ mɔ̃ onse mbiɔ a mpuru a Nziã. Mbuul ondɛ akieel amwɛn fool onse mbaa y'ɔ̃fel wa sofolo, ke nkwel ãnzwel mã ngel, bvool ke nkwel a Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Yoo e mbaa yi etuaal bɔ mpal eyi ywel kɛn oyi. Baal b'abuɛɛn nyam y'etiɔ e ndɛ, b'abɔɔ eliĩ e nkuũ a ndɛ, k'awuun wɛ, ekal me tsia, ekal me mwiĩ.»<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Li lio lɛn ba ngel, b'asa ãndɔɔ m'etam Ngel a Nziã osa, bvool ali y'okiool me Yeso, abvaan akal y'osɛ-mwiĩ.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Mɛ̃ ngyoo nkii efi ywel, elieel mɛ̃ bubu: «Swɛn bubu: “Esɛ ngamfɛn ola bɔ meba, bɔ b'akwa onse bvoo ye Mfam. Ngwanywã, Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal olieel ndiri: Yɔɔl kwɛn bɔ awuun m'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bɔ, ke ngwel wɛ ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bɔ ɛ̃luɛɛn a bɔ.”»<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oka o nsia e nsie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Mɛ̃ mwɛn epɛn ki fuu, nkal a kyɛ, éli ye mbuul me nsɛn, wɛn k'emfa onge Muaan a mbuul. Ndɛ álaal nkal yi ɔɔl nkal ɔ̃tswɛ, ásiin mbieel yi ɔ̃yiin-a-ɔ̃yiin yi ápɛɛl me kuɔɔl. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Ãnzwel ãkyam ãpal onse mboo a Nziã yi ɔ̃nsensal, ãbiool m'ã́bvi nsɛn nkal epɛn ndiri: «Naan mbieel a yɛ yi ɔ̃yiin-a-yiin, bvool ka nsia! Ke ngwel wɛ, lio emeekoo li aka nsia, nsia e nsie emeebie.» <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Wu áli me nsɛn nkal epɛn onaan mbieel a ndɛ yi ɔ̃yiin-a-yiin me nsie, bu aki nsia e yɔ.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Ãnzwel ãkyam ãpal onse mboo a Nziã yi ɔ̃nsensal yike ywel. Mɔ̃ hɛ̃ ã́siin mbieel yi ɔ̃yiin-a-yiin yi ápɛɛl.<verse eid="REV 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Ãnzwel ãkyam, m'ã́li ye waan nkal a mbaa ãpal ke nkiin yi awa Nziã ãkab, bvool ãbiool m'ã́li ye mbieel yi ɔ̃yiin-a-yiin yi ápɛɛl ndiri: «Naan mbieel a yɛ yi ɔ̃yiin-ayiin yi ápɛɛl, bvool ka ensɔɔ̃ e bvine li eli me nsie, ke ngwel wɛ nsia e lɔ emeebie.» <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Ãnzwel bu ãtyel mbieel a mɔ̃ yi ɔ̃yiin-ayiin me nsie. Mɔ̃ ãki bvine li nsie, bvool ãtyel lɔ onse saan li nɛn li abekyɛɛl nsia onse lɔ li mpuru a Nziã. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Anyiĩ nsia e bvine onse saan li nɛn lɔ. Saan olɔ k'éli onse bviil wɛ. Ãkel ãpal onse saan olɔ. Mɔ̃ ãtsɔɔn m'akilometele ɛ̃nkam ɛ̃tyel (300), bu ãluul tiil k'ɛ̃mpaã mi alɔ onse ɛ̃nywã mi aswebval.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ãnzwel nsiaan y'eywiri nsiaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Mɛ̃ bu mwɛn eliĩ ke ywel, eliĩ ki nɛn bvool ki ɛ̃kam. Eliĩ okyɛ ki ãnzwel nsiaan m'ã́kesiin eywiri nsiaan. Eywiri obvɛ eli ntɔ, ke ngwel wɛ me bvɛ, mpuru a Nziã emɔɔn.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Mɛ̃ bvool mwɛn eluɔ kyɛn onge ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa m'ãli kal-a-kal onge bvɛɛl, m'amvee ye mbaa. Nkal ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa omɔ̃, baal b'abvel nyam mpɛn, y'etiɔ e ndɛ, y'ɔ̃bvɛn wa nsiil ye nkuũ a ndɛ atɛɛn oŋɔ̃, bvool asiin ãnguɔ̃ m'éwi Nziã bɔ. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Bɔ ayam nziĩ a Moyize wu ɔ̃sal a Nziã ye nziĩ a Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃. Bɔ ayam bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">«Mfam Nziã, Nziã-Nga-Waan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ yɛ ɛ̃li mi ɛ̃nɛn bvool mi ɛ̃kam!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Ɔ̃kwɛn a ɛ̃kiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">ãnkuul ã yɛ ãli dzu bvool ãli taa-taa!<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Mfam, wu oli Ɔ̃nsensal kɛn a yam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">wɛn olɔ k'abal bvool olweel nkuũ a yɛ wɛ nã?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Ngwanyã, ɛ̃kiri mvieel ɛ̃kieel eya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">bvool ɛ̃bva ãbuo ke nkwel a yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">ke ngwel wɛ yɛ suo kwɛn yɛ li dzu!»<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, mɛ̃ mwɛn kwɛn ke ywel, éli ye nzɔ yi m'ebaan bvi anyam yi etsweel kwɛn Nziã oli oŋɔ̃. Onse yɔ, éli ye mboo ã Nziã yi ɔ̃nsensal yi ezweel nzuru. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Ãnzwel nsiaan m'ákesiin eywiri nsiaan ãpal onse mboo a Nziã yi ɔ̃nsensal. Mɔ̃ ã́laal ekɔ ki ata me lɛ̃ ki tsɛtsɛ, ki enyɛɛn. Mɔ̃ bvool álaal ɔ̃sii wa ɔɔl me luu. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Ngemɔ̃ onse eluɔ bvi mwiĩ enge-enã, ewi ãnzwel nsiaan asaan nsiaan ba ɔɔl, b'ãluu me mpuru a Nziã wu oli y'elaã ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Mboo a Nziã yi ɔ̃nsensal oyɔ eluul me yoo, me ndɔɔ a lweel e Nziã ye waan e ndɛ. Tiil ye k'ebwel eywiri enge-nsiaan bvi ãnzwel nsiaan, mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'ákekoo k'asam onse okɔ wɛ.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Asiaan nsiaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Mɛ̃ ngyoo nkii ngamɔ̃ yi kokɔ efi onse mboo a Nziã yi ɔ̃nsensal, yɔ ékeyɛɛn ãnzwel nsiaan bubu: «Eyi, etsal asaan a mpuru a Nziã me nsie!»<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Ãnzwel m'ɛ̃kwel ãyɛn ãyetsal saan a mɔ̃ me nsie. Ãbwɔɔ m'ãnɛn bvool m'ãluu bibi ãbɔɔl me baal b'áli y'eliĩ e nyam bvool ákebuɛɛn etiɔ e ndɛ.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Ãnzwel mã mbuaal ãtsal saan e mɔ̃ onse ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa, ãdza omɔ̃ bu ãkɔɔl ãkel, mɛn onge mã mbuul wu okwi. Eluɔ bvi mwiĩ bvi éli onse ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa bu ekwi-ekwi.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Ãnzwel m'ãtyel ãtsal saan e mɔ̃ onse ãnzal y'ɛ̃tswɛ mi amvieel. Ãdza mbueel bu ãkɔɔl ãkel. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Mɛ̃ bu ngyoo ãnzwel m'ãli y'okwɛn nkal ãdza ãlieel bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">«Yɛ wu oli bvool wu áli, yɛ wu li Ɔ̃nsensal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">yɛ li dzu, me ndɔɔ yi etsiil yɛ ãndɔɔ m'emfa okyɛ.<verse eid="REV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Ngwanyã, bɔ átsal ãkel ã ba ngel ye m'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:6">yɛ bu wi bɔ ãkel m'anywã.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:6">Ngwanyã, oyɔ ndɔɔ yi ebvaan me bɔ.»<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Mɛ̃ ngyoo nkii ngamɔ̃ efi onse nkiin yi awa Nziã ãkab, yɔ ékeyɛɛn bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">«Ngwanyã, Mfam Nziã, Nziã-Nga-Waan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">yɛ abetsiil ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki taa-taa ye ki dzu.»<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Ãnzwel m'ãnã ãtsal saan e mɔ̃ nkal a tal. Bu awi lɔ nkuul yi adziool baal me mbaa. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Baal bu adzio me mwiĩ ndyam wa kokɔ. Bɔ abvi nkuũ a Nziã wa y'okwɛn nkal ãmpal m'ãnɛn omɔ̃ osiaan. Bɔ abee k'akaal ɛ̃kwal ke nkwel a Nziã bvool abee k'alweel ndɛ.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Ãnzwel m'ãtaan ãtsal saan e mɔ̃ nkal a kiri li okwɛn e nyam. Okwɛn o ndɛ oyii osii empeel. Baal bu ayii atiɛɛn miin me mpuru a fool. <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />Bɔ abvi Nziã wa ke ywel osiaan me ndɔɔ ãmpal y'ãbwɔɔ ã bɔ m'ãnɛn, bvool bɔ k'ayɔɔl ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bɔ mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi wɛ.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Ãnzwel m'ãsɛɛn ãtsal saan e mɔ̃ nkal a nzal yi nɛn yi Efalate. Ãdza bu ãkɛɛ, me ndɔɔ yi afaal akwɛn b'afa ɛ̃kiri m'etswi ki epal tal nkuul. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Mɛ̃ mwɛn k'epal ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi ɛ̃tyel, myɛn onge ãkwɔɔ. Myɛ̃ ɛ̃pal m'ɔ̃nywã a dalagɔ̃, m'ɔ̃nywã a nyam, m'ɔ̃nywã wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn wa mfya. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Eli ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi mi ebesa emvieel, bvool ɛ̃beyi ol'akwɛn b'ɔ̃kiri a nsie wueel, me ndɔɔ yi abvool bɔ me ndɔɔ a mvel yi tsoo li nɛn e Nziã, Nziã-Nga-Waan.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />Mfam Nziã oyɛɛn bubu: «Yoo, mɛ̃ eya onge mbuul a pfuul. Esɛ ola mbuul wu akal ngɔ-mwiĩ bvool akwɛɛ ekɔ e ndɛ, kwɛn abee odzuũ odzuu, kwɛn opfuru o ndɛ obee omɔɔn.» <verse eid="REV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi omyɛ̃ ɛ̃bvool akwɛn ke mboo yi ata m'ɔ̃nywã wu Ebele me Haamagedɔ̃.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Ãnzwel mã nsiaan ãtsal saan e mɔ̃ endii-ywel. Nkii ngamɔ̃ yi nɛn efi ke mboo a Nziã yi ɔ̃nsensal, ke kiri e ndɛ li okwɛn, yɔ ékeyɛɛn ndiri: «Ŋ'asi!» <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Amvel abɛɛn, ãnkii ãyɛɛn, anzyel asiaan, nsie enziool nzuru yam kokɔ, m'emfa kyɛn mwɛn-endɛɛl baal okal me nsie, ãndɔɔ kɛn ãbwel m'emfa okyɛ wɛ. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Akab bviil li nɛn m'ebaal etyel. Ãbviil m'ɛ̃kiri ãtsɔɔn, bvool Nziã oyeel Babilon wu Ɔ̃nɛn, m'owa o ndɛ mbiɔ a ndɛ yi bvine li mpuru a ndɛ yi kokɔ. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Esanga bvieel ebal, ãnkio ãdziɔɔn. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Mvel wu ãkyal wa kokɔ ofi ywel ondwɔɔ nkal a baal. Ãkyal omɔ̃ ãli y'olyam bam bibi. Baal asiaan Nziã, me ndɔɔ a eywiri ki mvel wu ãkyal ondɛ. Ngwanyã, eywiri okyɛ éli kyam ki ongɛɛ.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s1">Bviil li nɛn li esio ye nyam wa bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ngãmɔ̃ onse ãnzwel nsiaan m'ã́kesiin asaan nsiaan ãyeyɛɛn ye mɛ̃. Mɔ̃ ayɛɛn ye mɛ̃ ndiri: «Ya, mɛ̃ èsuo yɛ etumbu e bviil li nɛn li esio. Bviil olɔ, li átuu nku-a-nku amvieel bibi. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Akwɛn a nsie asi esio ye lɔ, bvool baal a nsie mbal m'esio ã lɔ ãbɔɔ.»<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Ãnzwel ãbiri mɛ̃ m'Ɔ̃fel onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ. Mɛ̃ bu mwɛn ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ me nsɛn nkal a nyam wa bɛ. Nkal a nzuru a nyam ondɛ yueel, ápwɛɛ ãnkuũ m'ãsiaan Nziã. Ndɛ áli y'ɛ̃tswɛ nsiaan y'ãnsiɛɛn kuun. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Ɔ̃kaal ondɛ álaal ekɔ ki ɔ̃bvɛn ki bɛ. Ndɛ álaal hɛ̃ ɛ̃luu mi ɔɔl, ãnkɔɔn m'ɔ̃bvɛn y'ãlie m'ɔ̃bvɛn. Onse kuɔɔl e ndɛ, ndɛ ásiin saan li ɔɔl. Saan olɔ éluul m'ãndɔɔ mɛn Nziã k'adzii wɛ, ye mbiin yi esio e ndɛ. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Nkal a mbwii a ndɛ, áswɛn nkuũ ngamɔ̃ yɛn otsɛn oli m'edziɔɔn. Nkuun oyɔ yɔ bu: «Bviil li nɛn li Babilon, ngoo a anga-esio ye wu ãndɔɔ mɛn Nziã k'adzii wɛ mã nsie.» <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Mɛ̃ mwɛn ɔ̃kaal ondɛ amaanywa ãkel m'ãmaabɔɔ ndɛ onge mbal. Ãkel omɔ̃ ãli ãkel ã baal ba ngel ye m'atsweel a Yeso. Ŋe mwɛn mɛ̃ ndɛ, esi mɛ̃ ɛ̃kam myam bibi. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Ãnzwel ãlieel mɛ̃ bubu: «Ki ekam yɛ emã? Mɛ̃ ndyam èwa yɛ otsɛn bo m'edziɔɔn b'ɔ̃kaal ye nyam wu obiri ndɛ, nyam wu oli y'ɛ̃tswɛ nsiaan y'ãnsiɛɛn kuun. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Nyam wu emwɛn yɛ áli tsɔɔn mwiĩ, kɛn a meba, ndɛ k'abekal wɛ. Ndɛ àpal onse ywɛn li ela li ke nsɛn a nsie, bvool àyi nkel. Baal a nsie bɛn ãnkuũ k'áswɛn onse ɔ̃nkaan wu elaã fa ŋ'ési Nziã ɔ̃kiri wɛ, akieel akam ŋ'ekieel emwɛn bɔ nyam. Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ tsɔɔn áli mwiĩ, meba ndɛ k'abekal wɛ. Kɛn a ndɛ akieel apal bvool.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Yi mboo yɛn ebvaan akal y'ãyal y'ɔ̃nyiã. Ɛ̃tswɛ nsiaan ɛ̃li ãnkio nsiaan m'eli ɔ̃kaal me nsɛn nkal a mɔ̃. Eli hɛ̃ akwɛn nsiaan. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Akwɛn ataan abvi, wu asɛɛn kɛn oli m'ompu, wa nsiaan kɛn ayi wɛ. Ŋ'ekieel eya ndɛ, ndɛ àkal m'ompu lio etsi-etsiri. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Me b'otal nyam wɛn tsɔɔn áli mwiĩ, bvool wɛn k'abekal wɛ, ndyam oli ɔ̃kwɛn wa mpuɔ̃. Ndɛ oli hɛ̃ ngɔmɔ̃ onse anyam nsiaan, ndɛ àyi nkel.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />Ãnsiɛɛn kuun m'emwɛn yɛ ãli akwɛn kuun, bɛn kɛn abɔɔ mpu wɛ. Kɛn a bɔ àbɔɔ okwɛn b'akal m'ompu ye nyam lio etsi-tsiri. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Akwɛn obɔ ange-kuun ali y'ãtsam ngãmɔ̃. Ãtsam omɔ̃ m'ewa bɔ nyam waan ye mpu a bɔ. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Bɔ akieel adzɔɔ Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ eta, kɛn a Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ akieel abvel bɔ mpɛn, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ oli Mfam wu onduru amfam bueel, bvool oli Ɔ̃kwɛn wu onduru akwɛn bueel. Ndɛ akieel abvel bɔ mpɛn, ndɛ ye b'éti Nziã mbel, b'ésueel ndɛ, b'ákuru nzuru me ndɛ.»<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Ãnzwel bvool ãlieel mɛ̃ bubu: «Ãdza m'emwɛn yɛ, m'eli nga-esio me nsɛn nkal a mɔ̃, eli ãsel ã baal, embuul e baal, ɛ̃kiri y'ɛ̃nywã. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Me b'otal ãnsiɛɛn kuun m'emwɛn yɛ, ye nyam, eluɔ obvɛ ekieel ebyal nga-esio, embaal ndɛ bvieel bvi eli a ndɛ, bvool esiil ndɛ odzuũ-odzuũ. Bvɛ ekieel edza tuo e ndɛ, bvool ekieel etsoo bvi esiil bvieel mbaa. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã olɔ onse ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bvɛ ãtsam m'asa m'éwɛɛ ndɛ, m'akal m'ɔ̃dzi me ndɔɔ yi awa nyam waan e bvɛ, tiil k'asa m'éyɛɛn Nziã.<verse eid="REV 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Ɔ̃kaal wu emwɛn yɛ, eli bviil li nɛn li eli y'okwɛn nkal akwɛn a nsie.»<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s1">Obva o Babilɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, mɛ̃ mwɛn ãnzwel ngãmɔ̃ ãkyam ãfi ywel ãsool. Mɔ̃ áli ye waan li nɛn, bvool nsie yueel éyɔɔl me mbaa a lweel e mɔ̃. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Mɔ̃ ãbiool bubu: «Lɔ ebvi, lɔ ebvi, bviil li nɛn li Babilon! Lɔ eyii lɔɔ li ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi, mboo yi edziɔɔn ɔ̃fel wueel wa mbiin, mboo yi edziɔɔn anywɛn a mbiin bueel, mboo yi edziɔɔn anyam a mbiin bueel b'ebyal baal. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ɛ̃kiri mvieel ɛ̃nywĩ mbal ã mpuru a esio e lɔ. Akwɛn a nsie asi esio ye lɔ bvool baal b'ata obɔɔ̃ me nsie ayii y'opfel me nkuul opfel o lɔ b'onduru ɔ̃ndel.»<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Ke mbee ɔŋɔ̃, mɛ̃ ngyoo nkii nkyam fa ywel, yɔ ékeyɛɛn ndiri: «Baal a mɛ̃, epal onse bviil olɔ, kwɛn byɛ ebee obvɔɔn y'ãbi ã lɔ, bvool kwɛn byɛ ebee fool li eywiri e lɔ omwɛn. <verse eid="REV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ãbi ã lɔ ãyii mam bibi ãnɔɔn tiil ywel. Nziã oyeel hɛ̃ ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ lɔ mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi. <verse eid="REV 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Esa lɔ onge b'esi lɔ bakyɛ, bvool ebveel lɔ m'esi lɔ nsa yuaal. Onse mbiɔ yiyi yi etwɛɛl ndɛ bakyɛ mbal, etwɛɛl ndɛ m'ãnduru mpuru nsa yuaal. <verse eid="REV 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Emfa ngemɔ̃ ki éli lɔ y'ondɛɛl o nzuru bvool ésuo opfel o lɔ, emfa kiki hɛ̃ etuaal lɔ mpal, bvool esuul lɔ ekal y'ãwua. Ke ngwel wɛ, bviil olɔ eyɛɛn ndiri: “Mɛ̃ bvi nsɛn onge ɔ̃kwɛn wu ɔ̃kaal, mɛ̃ ke ndi ɔ̃kaal wu opfiil wɛ, mɛ̃ kieel k'elaal mpiri bam wɛ.” <verse eid="REV 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Obobɔ, eywiri bvi áyɛɛl me ndɔɔ a lɔ ekieel eya nkal a lɔ kɛn a tsoo ngelemɔ̃. Eywiri obvɛ bvɛ bvi: Epfu, mpiri, y'ɔ̃lɔɔ. M'emfa okyɛ, akieel atyal lɔ onse mbaa. Ke ngwel wɛ, Mfam Nziã wu owi lɔ etumbu oli nga-mpɛn.»<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Akwɛn a nsie b'ási esio ye lɔ bvool ásuo opfel ye lɔ, akieel alel bvool aluɔɔl me ndɔɔ a lɔ, ŋ'ekieel emwɛn bɔ yoo li ekieel esii lɔ kal. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Bɔ akieel atɛɛn lala ye lɔ, me buɔ b'ãmpal ã lɔ mã kokɔ. Bɔ akieel ayɛɛn bubu: «Li fool li bwɛn! Li fool li bwɛn! Babilon, bviil li nɛn, Babilon, bviil li mpɛn! Etumbu e yɛ eyi kɛn a me lio etsi-tsiri!»<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃, baal b'ata obɔɔ̃ me nsie alel bvool alaal mpiri me ndɔɔ a bviil olɔ, ke ngwel wɛ mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'abesuun eluɔ e bɔ bvi obɔɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />Eluɔ obvɛ eli ɔɔl, aadzã, ãnkɔɔn m'ɔ̃bvɛn, ãlie m'ɔ̃bvɛn, ekɔ bvi ebvɛ-ebvɛ, ekɔ bvi ɔ̃bvɛn bvi bɛ, ekɔ bvi swa, y'eluɔ bvikyɛ bvi emfa bwɛn emfa bvi asi m'ɛ̃ti mi nswel yi mvɛ ye mi ɔ̃bvɛn, ye bvi asi m'ansiɛɛn m'anzɔɔ, ye bvieel li bolonze ye li fɛɛl, ye nkɔɔn yi ɔ̃bvɛn yi maabele. <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />Eluɔ bvi emfa bwɛn emfa bvi ewa bvi-odza ãkiin, miil, ɔ̃ywiri, ãnasi, bvine, mbaal, faline, bele, angwɛmbɛ, emɛmɛɛ̃, aswebval, aswaal, ebiĩ y'ɛ̃fel ɛ̃ baal. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Bɔ b'ata obɔɔ̃ obɔ akieel ayɛɛn ye Babilɔ̃ ndiri: «Nsia yi emeebie yi eli yɛ y'ɔ̃tio me yɔ esyel lala ye yɛ. Eluɔ obvɛ bvieel bvi ɔ̃bvɛn bvool bvi ebvɛ-ebvɛ, yɛ ywɛn a bvɛ, bvool k'àbebɔɔ bvɛ bvool bam wɛ.» <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Baal b'ata obɔɔ̃ b'ayii y'opfel me ndɔɔ a lɔ akieel atɛɛn lala me buɔ o fool e ndɛ. Bɔ akieel alel bvool alaal mpiri, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">«Li fool li bwɛn! Li fool li bwɛn! Bviil li nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">li elaal ekɔ e lɛ̃ bvi ebvɛ-ebvɛ, li elaal ekɔ bvi ɔ̃bvɛn bvi bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">Lɔ éluul me ɔɔl, m'ãnkɔɔn m'ɔ̃bvɛn bvool m'ãlie m'ɔ̃bvɛn! <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Kɛn a me lio etsi-tsiri, opfel bo boo-boo bubu oyɛn nkel!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Adzoo b'ãsua bueel, b'ayi dzwɛ li ãsua, b'asal k'ãdza onse ãsua, ye b'ata obɔɔ̃ bo me nzal, atɛɛn lala ye lɔ. <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />Ŋ'ékemwɛn bɔ yoo li ekesii bviil olɔ kal, bɔ ákebiool bubu: «Wu áli onge bviil li nɛn nã?» <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Bɔ áketyal ɔ̃fel nkal ɛ̃tswɛ, ákelel, ákelaal mpiri, bvool ákebiool ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">«Li fool li bwɛn!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">Li fool li bwɛn!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">Bviil li nɛn li lɛn opfel o lɔ ósi kwɛn bueel b'áli y'ãsua k'ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa ayii apfel, bu eyɛn nkel kɛn a me lio ngelemɔ̃!»<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Yɛ wu ywel, sia mpaa me ndɔɔ a bviil olɔ! Byɛ ba ngel, y'antam y'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, esia mpaa hɛ̃! Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã osi ndɔɔ yi dzu, ŋ'ewi ndɛ lɔ etumbu.<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Ãnzwel ngãmɔ̃ mã ye waan ãwel nkɔɔn yɛn onge ãsin m'ãnɛn m'ãkyɛɛl nsia, bu atyel yɔ k'ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa, y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: «Bviil li nɛn li Babilon, okyɛ emfa ki akieel atyal lɔ ye kɔɔ-kɔɔ ke nsɛn, bvool kieel k'abemwɛn lɔ bam wɛ. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Ola yɛ, kieel k'abeyoo esingi ki abɛɛl b'ãnguɔ̃ bam wɛ, k'abeyoo b'asio mpaa bam wɛ, ekal b'afel ãnsiɛɛn, ekal b'afel amvel-a-mvel bam wɛ. Kieel k'abebɔɔ mbuul wu asa ɔ̃sal a mviɔɔl si ngɔmɔ̃ bam wɛ. Ola yɛ, k'abeyoo nkyal yi ãsin m'ãkyɛɛl nsia bam wɛ. <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Mbaa a mbunda kieel k'ebengal ola yɛ bam wɛ, k'abeyoo nkii a ɔ̃baal wu bɔɔl ye wu ɔ̃kaal ola yɛ bam wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, baal a yɛ b'ata obɔɔ̃ áli amfam a nsie, yɛ ápfuru ɛ̃kiri mvieel m'ebel e yɛ.»<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Ke bviil olɔ, amwɛn ãkel m'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, mã ba ngel, ye mã baal bueel b'ábam me nsie.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="s1">Nziĩ y'olweel o Nziã ke ywel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, mɛ̃ ngyoo nkii yɛn onge nkii yi embuul e baal ki bibi ke ywel. Bɔ ákeyɛɛn kokɔ bubu: «Aleluya! Obvuul, ye lweel, ye waan, eli bvi Nziã a bia-byɛ! <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ atsiil ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki taa-taa bvool ki edzu. Ndɛ owi nga-esio wu ɔ̃nɛn etumbu me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ ákebiil ɔ̃kiri m'esio e ndɛ. Ndɛ osi kwɛn ndɛ afuru obi o ndɛ b'ébam ndɛ asal a ndɛ.» <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Embuul elieel li nsa yuaal ndiri: «Aleluya! Yoo li esii ndɛ kal ekeyi ywel ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu!» <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Akuul-kuul ange-ãku-mbuaal y'ãnã (24) y'eluɔ bvi mwiĩ enã abvi ãbuo, alweel Nziã wu áli me nsɛn nkal a kiri li okwɛn. Bɔ alieel ndiri: «Amɛn! Aleluya!»<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pfuun e bal e Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Nkii ngamɔ̃ efi kiri li okwɛn eyɛɛn ndiri: «Elweel Nziã a bia-byɛ, byɛ bueel b'asal a ndɛ, byɛ b'ebal ndɛ, akiɔɔl y'akuul!» <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Mɛ̃ bu ngyoo nkii yɛn onge nkii e embuul e baal bibi, yɛn onge nkyal yi ekuu ãdza mã bibi, bvool onge nkyal yi osiaan b'anzyel bo kokɔ. Nkii oyɔ ékeyɛɛn bubu: «Aleluya! Ke ngwel wɛ, Mfam Nziã a bia-byɛ, Nziã-Ngaa-Waan, osuo okwɛn o ndɛ. <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Bia-byɛ esia mpaa, eluul m'esɛ, bvool elweel ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ lio e bal e Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ ekoo, ɔ̃kal a ndɛ amaawal ɔ̃yɛɛl. <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Awi ndɛ mpwee yi alaal ekɔ ki lɛ̃ ki ɔ̃bvɛn, ki enyɛɛn, bvool ki tsɛtsɛ.» Ekɔ ki lɛ̃ ki ɔ̃bvɛn eli ãndɔɔ mã dzu m'esa ba ngel.<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Ãnzwel ãlieel mɛ̃ bubu: «Swɛn wɛn: “Esɛ ngamfɛn ola baal bɛn ati bɔ mbel ke pfuun e bal e Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃!”» Mɔ̃ bvool ãlieel mɛ̃ bubu: «Omɔ̃ ãyɛɛn ã Nziã mã taa-taa.»<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Mɛ̃ mvi ke ntaã e mɔ̃ me ndɔɔ yi elweel mɔ̃, kɛn a mɔ̃ ãlieel mɛ̃ bubu: «Oyɛɛ ke sa obobɔ wɛ! Mɛ̃ ndi kɛn a ndoo a yɛ wu ɔ̃sal, ye wu andoo a yɛ b'atsweel Yeso. Wu elweel yɛ Nziã!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:10">Nzal-a-ŋɛn, ãyɛɛn m'éyiaal Yeso baal, Ɔ̃fel wu abewa mɔ̃ ol'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuul wu ɔ̃nɔɔn nkal swebval wa fuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Mɛ̃ bu mwɛn ywel kal, swebval wa fuu opal. Wu onɔɔn nkal a ndɛ, nkuũ a ndɛ «Wɛn k'akwɛɛn k'asa b'élieel ndɛ wɛ» bvool «Wa Taa-Taa». Ndɛ atsiil ãndɔɔ bvool adzɔɔ eta m'emfa ki dzu. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Mviil ã ndɛ ãli onge mbaa yi ékengal. Nkal ɔ̃tswɛ a ndɛ, éli y'ekɔrɔ bvi okwɛn bibi. Ndɛ oli ye nkuũ yi áswɛn yɛn mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'ayɛɛ wɛ. Wu oyɛɛ yɔ kɛn a ndyam. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Ndɛ bvool olaal ekɔ ki abueel m'ãkel. Nkuũ a ndɛ eli Endɔɔ e Nziã. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Ambwel-mbwel b'ali ke ywel ákenɔɔn a ndɛ nkal aswebval b'afuu-fuu, alaal ekɔ bvi lɛ̃ bvi ɔ̃bvɛn, bvi afuu-fuu bvool bvi tsɛtsɛ. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Epwel ngemɔ̃ ki ápɛɛl epal onse ɔ̃nywã a ndɛ. Ndɛ abɛɛl ɛ̃kiri me kyɛ. Ndɛ wu akieel abiri ɛ̃kiri omyɛ̃ ye nkoo yueel. Ndɛ bvool wu adziaal nsia e bvine onse saan li nɛn li abekyɛɛl nsia onse lɔ li mpuru a Nziã Nga-Waan. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Nkal ekɔ y'ebyal a ndɛ, ákel nkuun yi: «Mfam wu onduru amfam bueel, Ɔ̃kwɛn wu onduru akwɛn bueel.»<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Mɛ̃ mwɛn ãnzwel ngãmɔ̃ tɛ onse tal. Mɔ̃ ãbiool anywɛn bueel b'ákepɔɔn bam nkal ãntɛ ndiri: «Eya, kwɛn byɛ ebvɔɔn me ndɔɔ a odza o Nziã b'onɛn! <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />Eyedza tuo li akwɛn, tuo li ambiri b'ambwel-mbwel, tuo li awaan, tuo li aswebval ye b'anɔɔn nkal a bɔ, tuo e baal bueel, ankyal ye ba ndii, akiɔɔl y'akuul!»<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Mɛ̃ mwɛn nyam, akwɛn a nsie y'ambwel-mbwel a bɔ. Bɔ abvɔɔn me ndɔɔ yi adzwaan ye wu onɔɔn nkal a swebval y'ambwel-mbwel a ndɛ. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Asiin nyam y'ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn wa mfya. Ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn ondɛ, wu ási emvieel ke nkwel a nyam, m'emfa kyɛn ndɛ ápfuru b'ábɔɔ eliĩ e nyam bvool ákebuɛɛn etiɔ. Atyel nyam y'ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn wa mfya amwiĩ-mwiĩ onse ywɛn e mbaa y'ɔ̃fel wa sofolo. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Abam bakyɛ m'epwel ki ékepal onse ɔ̃nywã a wu ákenɔɔn nkal a swebval, bvool anywɛn bueel ayedza tuo e bɔ.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s1">Akuru Satana mvel miil ngɔmɔ̃ (1.000)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Mɛ̃ bu mwɛn ãnzwel ngãmɔ̃ ãfi ywel. Onse kuɔɔl, mɔ̃ ãsiin ɔ̃wɔɔl a ywɛn li ela li ke nsɛn a nsie ye mpaa yam yi nɛn. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Ãnzwel omɔ̃ ãyesiin dalagɔ̃, wu ntaal wa tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn, wu oli ɔ̃pfu bvool oli Satana, bu akuru ndɛ mpaa yi esa ye ndɛ mvel miil ngɔmɔ̃ (1.000). <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Mɔ̃ ãtyel ndɛ onse ywɛn li ela li ke nsɛn a nsie, ãwɔɔl lɔ, bu ãsi eliĩ ke ywel a lɔ kwɛn ndɛ abee ɛ̃kiri obepfuru tiil k'ekoo mvel miil ngɔmɔ̃ (1.000). Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ebvaan kwɛn apaal ndɛ me ndɔɔ a lio etsi-etsiri. <verse eid="REV 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Mɛ̃ mwɛn ãkiri m'okwɛn. Awi b'abvi nsɛn nkal a mɔ̃ okwɛn b'atsiil ãndɔɔ. Mɛ̃ mwɛn hɛ̃ baal b'átsiil ɛ̃tswɛ m'ekuu me ndɔɔ yi étsweel bɔ Yeso y'Endɔɔ e Nziã, bvool ábee k'abuɛɛn onkyam nyam, onkyam etiɔ e ndɛ, ye bɛn k'ábɔɔ eliĩ me mbwii wuo me kuɔɔl wɛ. Bɔ asiool bvool akal m'ompu ye Mãsia mvel miil ngɔmɔ̃ (1.000). <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Bakyɛ b'ákwi k'asiool wɛ, tiil ye k'ebwel mvel miil ngɔmɔ̃ (1.000) oyɔ. Obɔ osiool b'ɛ̃kwel. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Esɛ ngamfɛn ola b'eseel Nziã ɛ̃kwel onse b'ákwi-ákwi, bɔ ali ba ngel. Epfu li yuaal k'eli y'okwɛn nkal a bɔ wɛ. Bɔ akieel akal angaa-a-Nziã bvool ba Mãsia. Bɔ akieel akal m'ompu ye ndɛ wu Mãsia mvel miil ngɔmɔ̃ (1.000).<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abvel Satana mpɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Ŋ'ekieel ekoo mvel miil ngɔmɔ̃ (1.000), akieel apaal Satana me bwal e ndɛ. <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />Ndɛ akieel ayepfuru Gog ye Magog, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri ãyam ã baal b'ɛ̃soo ɛ̃ nsie ɛ̃nge-ɛ̃na. Ndɛ akieel abvool bɔ me ndɔɔ yi adzwaan eta. Bɔ akieel akal booboo onge esɛɛ bvi nku-a-nku ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Bɔ akɔɔn me nsie yueel, bvool adzii mboo yi eli ba ngel ye bviil e ndɛ li ɔ̃tio. Kɛn a mbaa efi ywel edziool bɔ. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Ɔ̃pfu wu ákepfuru bɔ, atyel ndɛ onse ywɛn e mbaa y'ɔ̃fel a sofolo, mboo yi eli nyam y'ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn wa mfya. Bɔ akieel amwɛn fool ɔ̃bu, tsia mwiĩ.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otsiil b'ãndɔɔ bo ntɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Mɛ̃ bu mwɛn kiri li okwɛn li nɛn li fuu ye wu ábvi nsɛn nkal a lɔ. Nsie ye ywel ebal ke nkwel a lɔ, bvool k'abemwɛn bvɛ wɛ. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Mɛ̃ bu mwɛn b'ákwi-ákwi, akuul y'akiɔɔl, tɛ ke nkwel a kiri li okwɛn. Adzweel ɛ̃nkaan bvool adzweel ɔ̃nkaan ɔ̃kyam wu oli ɔ̃nkaan wu elaã. Atsiil ãndɔɔ ã b'ákwi-ákwi onge b'ákel onse ɛ̃nkaan omyɛ̃, m'emfa ki ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bɔ. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa ãloo b'ákwi-ákwi me mɔ̃, epfu y'ola o b'ákwi-ákwi, oloo b'áli okɔ: Atsiil ãndɔɔ ã bɔ, mbuul bwɛn a mbuul m'emfa ki ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Atyel epfu y'ola o b'ákwi-ákwi onse yɛɛ e mbaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">yɛɛ e mbaa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri ywɛn e mbaa.</char></note>. Yɛɛ e mbaa eli epfu li yuaal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">epfu li yuaal </char><char style="ft" closed="false">eli etumbu ki ɔ̃bu.</char></note>. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Mbuul wɛn nkuun k'áswɛn onse ɔ̃nkaan wu elaã wɛ, atyel ndɛ onse ywɛn e mbaa.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ywel li nyiɔɔn ye nsie yi nyiɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, mɛ̃ mwɛn ywel li nyiɔɔn ye nsie yi nyiɔɔn. Ywel li ɛ̃kwel ye nsie yi ɛ̃kwel édziɔɔn, bvool ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa k'ãbekal wɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Mɛ̃ bvool mwɛn Bviil li Ngel, Yelusalem wu ɔ̃nyiɔɔn ofi ywel ola Nziã, asool. Bviil olɔ éli onge ɔ̃kaal wu amaawal ɔ̃yɛɛl a bal, wu oti ompal me ndɔɔ yi ayemwɛɛn y'ɔ̃lam. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Mɛ̃ ngyoo nkii yi nɛn efi ke kiri li okwɛn, yɔ ékeyɛɛn bubu: «Meba mboo yi ekal Nziã eyii onse baal. Ndɛ akieel akal ye bɔ, bvool bɔ akieel akal baal a ndɛ. Nziã ndyam akieel akal ye bɔ, ndɛ akieel akal Nziã a bɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Ndɛ akieel akiɔɔn ãnsia mbueel me mviil ã bɔ. Epfu kieel k'ebekal bvool wɛ, ndwɔɔ k'ebekal wɛ, onkyam olel, onkyam mpal, ke ngwel wɛ ãndɔɔ mã tsɔɔn ŋ'ãbwel.»<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Obobɔ, wu ábvi nsɛn nkal a kiri li okwɛn olieel bubu: «Tal, mɛ̃ ŋensi ãndɔɔ mbueel m'ãnyiɔɔn.» Ndɛ bvool olieel ndiri: «Kel ãyɛɛn mã, ke ngwel wɛ mɔ̃ ãli mã taa-taa bvool ãbvaan m'okiool.»<verse eid="REV 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Ndɛ olieel mɛ̃ bvool bubu: «Ŋ'asi ãndɔɔ mbueel! Wu oli Alafa y'Omega mɛ̃, obɛɛn y'osɛɛl. Wu oli ye nzuaal, mɛ̃ èwa ndɛ ãdza mã ngwel m'ãfa k'ɔ̃tswɛ a mvieel wu elaã. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Mbuul wueel wu akieel abvel mpɛn àbɔɔ ebvakab okyɛ ola mɛ̃. Mɛ̃ èkal Nziã ndɛ, ndɛ àkal muaan a mɛ̃. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Kɛn ɛ̃bu-buɔ, ye bɛn k'akuru nzuru me Nziã wɛ, ye b'asa ãndɔɔ m'ebyal Nziã, y'abam a baal, y'anga-esio, y'anga-ebel, ye b'abuɛɛn etiɔ, ye baal a mfya bueel, mboo yi bɔ kieel ekal yɛɛ e mbaa y'ɔ̃fel a sofolo. Olɔ epfu li yuaal.»<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yelusalem wu ɔ̃nyiɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ngãmɔ̃ onse ãnzwel ãnge-nsiaan m'ã́kesiin asaan nsiaan m'ã́luul ntɔ m'eywiri enge-nsiaan bvi ntɔ, ãyeyɛɛn mɛ̃ bubu: «Ya, mɛ̃ èsuo yɛ ɔ̃kal wu ábaal, ɔ̃kal a Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃.»<verse eid="REV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Ãnzwel omɔ̃ bu ãbiri mɛ̃ m'Ɔ̃fel nkal a nkio yi nɛn bvool yi nda. Mɔ̃ ãsuo mɛ̃ Yelusalem, Bviil li Ngel, wu ofi ywel ola Nziã asool. <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />Bviil olɔ eluul me lweel e Nziã. Lɔ ékengal onge nkɔɔn yi ɔ̃bvɛn, onge nkɔɔn yi ɔ̃bvɛn yi Dzasepe yi kɛɛn onge Kilisital. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Lɔ éli y'ebɔɔ ki y'ɔ̃biɔɔn bvool ki y'ɔ̃tɔɔl. Lɔ éli y'ɛ̃nywã kuun ye mviaal. Ɔ̃nywã bwɛn ɔ̃nywã áli y'ãnzwel ngãmɔ̃ m'ã́kekiaal kyɛ. Ákel ãnkuun nkal edzoo obvɛ, ãnkuun omɔ̃ m'ãyam kuun ye mbuaal m'Isalayel. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />K'etswi ki epal tal, éli y'edzoo etyel, k'etswi ki nkio edzoo etyel, ke nsɛn edzoo etyel, k'etswi ki edziin tal edzoo etyel. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Átuu ebɔɔ e bviil olɔ nkal ãnkɔɔn kuun ye mbuaal. Nkal ãnkɔɔn omɔ̃, ákel ãnkuũ m'antam kuun ye buaal a Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Ãnzwel m'ã́keyɛɛn ye mɛ̃ áli y'ɔ̃mpaã wa ɔɔl, me ndɔɔ yi awal emvɛɛl e bviil, li edzoo ye li ebɔɔ e lɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Etswi e bviil enge-enã éli nsiil m'ola y'okuun. Ãnzwel ãwel emvɛɛl e bviil m'ɔ̃mpaã. Lɔ epal akilometele amiil buaal y'ɛ̃kam mviaal (2.200) m'ola, m'okuun, bvool m'ɔ̃tyal. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Mɔ̃ ãmvɛɛl ɔ̃biɔɔn wu ebɔɔ. Ndɛ opal ametele ɛ̃kuun-nsiaan ye buaal (72). Ãnzwel ãwel emvɛɛl m'efa ki ebesa baal. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Ebɔɔ átuu m'ãnkɔɔn mã Dzasepe. Bviil éli me ɔɔl li tsɛtsɛ li kɛɛn onge bvɛɛl li kɛɛn. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Ãnkɔɔn m'átuu ebɔɔ e bviil nkal a mɔ̃, áfaal mɔ̃ m'ãnkɔɔn m'ɔ̃bvɛn m'emfa bwɛn emfa. Ãnkɔɔn m'ɛ̃kwel m'átuu ebɔɔ ã́li ãnkɔɔn m'ɔ̃bvɛn mã Dzasepe, mã mbuaal ã́li mã Safiil, m'ãtyel ã́li mã Kalesedwane, m'ãnã ã́li m'Emelode. <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />M'ãtaan ã́li mã Salidonikse, m'ãsɛɛn ã́li mã Saadwane, mã nsiaan ã́li Kilidzolite, mã mpuɔ ã́li mã Belile, mã bva ã́li mã Topadze, mã kuun ã́li mã Kilidzopaladze, mã kuun y'ɔ̃mɔ̃ ã́li mã Dzasɛnte, mã kuun ye mbuaal ã́li m'Emetisite. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Edzoo enge-kuun ye bviaal eli m'ãnkɔɔn m'ɔ̃bvɛn kuun ye buaal, edzoo bwɛn a edzoo, ási kyɛ me nkɔɔn y'ɔ̃bvɛn ngamɔ̃. Bal-bal a bviil wu ɔ̃nɛn, ási ndɛ me ɔɔl li tsɛtsɛ, onge bvɛɛl li kɛɛn.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Mɛ̃ ke mwɛn mboo a Nziã yi ɔ̃nsensal wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mboo a lɔ yi ɔ̃nsensal eli Mfam Nziã wu Nziã-Nga-Waan, ye Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Bviil k'eli ye kɔɔ, ekal li tal, ekal li nswii wɛ, me ndɔɔ yi ayɛɛl lɔ, ke ngwel wɛ mbaa a lweel e Mfam Nziã eyɛɛl lɔ bvool mbunda a lɔ, Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Ɛ̃kiri ɛ̃kieel ɛ̃dzuu me mbaa a ndɛ, bvool akwɛn a nsie akieel ayewa lɔ opfel o bɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Edzoo e bviil olɔ, k'akieel akuru bvɛ me mwiĩ bam wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ, okɔ, k'ekal ye tsia wɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Akieel abiri lweel ye dzuun li ɛ̃kiri ke bviil olɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Eluɔ ngemɔ̃ ki mbiin kieel k'esam bam onse lɔ wɛ, ekal b'asa ãndɔɔ m'opfuru wuo mã mfya. B'akieel asam onse lɔ, kɛn a bɛn ãnkuũ ã bɔ ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan wu elaã wa Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃ti wu elaã ye nzal yi elaã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Ãnzwel ãsuo mɛ̃ hɛ̃ nzal ngamɔ̃ yi elaã, yi kɛɛn onge nkɔɔn yi ɔ̃bvɛn yi Kilisital. Yɔ epal onse kiri li okwɛn e Nziã ye li Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃, <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />bvool ebwel kal-a-kal a bal-bal a bviil wu ɔ̃nɛn. Nkal ekwel enge-bviaal bvi nzal oyɔ, éli y'ɔ̃ti wu elaã ngɔmɔ̃ wu ákeburu nsia nsa kuun ye yuaal me mvel, nsa ngamɔ̃ me nswii. Ãsɔɔ m'ɔ̃ti ondɛ ãbeboo baal b'ɛ̃kiri. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Obwel b'enkɛɛ kieel k'obekal wɛ. Kiri li okwɛn e Nziã ye li Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ ekieel ekal onse bviil. Asal a ndɛ akieel alweel ndɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Bɔ akieel amwɛn osu o ndɛ, nkuũ a ndɛ ekieel ekal nkal ãmbwii ã bɔ. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Tsia kieel k'abekal bvool wɛ, bvool bɔ kieel k'abekal ye kɔɔ, onkyam li oyɔɔl o mbunda, onkyam li oyɔɔl o tal wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ, Mfam Nziã akieel ayɛɛl bɔ. Bɔ akieel akal y'okwɛn ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso olieel ndiri ndɛ ŋ'asa eya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Obobɔ, ãnzwel ãlieel mɛ̃ bubu: «Ãyɛɛn omɔ̃ ãli mã taa-taa bvool m'ãbvaan m'okiool. Mfam, wu Nziã wu abewa aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn ãndɔɔ m'ebeyɛɛn bɔ, oyuɔɔl ãnzwel me ndɔɔ yi asuo asal a ndɛ ãndɔɔ m'ãsa ãya.<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />Yoo! Mɛ̃ ŋ'esa eya. Esɛ ngamfɛn ola wu ayoo ãyɛɛn m'ãfi ola Nziã bvool asa m'akel onse ɔ̃nkaan wu!»<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Mɛ̃ wu Dzaã, mɛ̃ wu ngyoo bvool mwɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃. Ŋe ngyoo mɛ̃ bvool mwɛn mɔ̃, mɛ̃ mvi ãbuo ke nkwel ãnzwel m'ã́kesuo mɛ̃ mɔ̃, me ndɔɔ yi ebuɛɛn mɔ̃. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Kɛn ãnzwel ãlieel mɛ̃ bubu: «Oyɛɛ ke sa obobɔ wɛ! Mɛ̃ ndi kɛn a ndoo a yɛ wu ɔ̃sal ye wu andoo a yɛ b'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, ye wa b'alweel ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nkaan wu. Wu ebuɛɛn yɛ Nziã!»<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Mɔ̃ bvool ãlieel mɛ̃ bubu: «Bee ãndɔɔ m'ãfi ola Nziã m'akel onse ɔ̃nkaan wu olwɔɔn, ke ngwel wɛ, lio ŋ'eyii esa ekoo. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Yɔɔl kwɛn wu oli ɔ̃bi, awɛɛl mpɛn m'obi obesa. Wa ye mbiin, awɛɛl mpɛn m'ãndɔɔ ã mbiin obesa! Wa dzu, awɛɛl mpɛn m'osa b'ãndɔɔ mã dzu! Wa ngel, awɛɛl mpɛn m'osa b'ãndɔɔ mã ngel!»<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Yoo! Mɛ̃ ŋ'esa eya. Mɛ̃ eya y'ebva-kab e mɛ̃, me ndɔɔ yi ewa mbuul bwɛn a mbuul kyɛ m'emfa ki ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Mɛ̃ ndi Alefa y'Omega, wa nkwel ye wa mbee, obɛɛn y'osɛɛl.»<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Esɛ ngamfɛn ola b'asuɔɔl ɛ̃nkuru ɛ̃ bɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn awa bɔ nkuul yi adza esia li ɔ̃ti wu elaã, bvool yi asam onse bviil m'ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃ lɔ. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Kɛn amva, anga-ebel, anga-esio, abam, abuɛɛn b'etiɔ ye mbuul ɔ̃bi pyɛ wu odzii mfya bvool abetsoo yɔ, àkal onkwel-a-nzi.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />Yeso olweel bubu: «Mɛ̃ wu Yeso, mɛ̃ ngyuɔɔl ãnzwel ã mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ yi atsweel byɛ ãndɔɔ m'ãtal ãbvɔɔn. Mɛ̃ wu ndi onge ɔ̃swɛɛn wu ɔ̃ti a David, ɔ̃tiɔɔl a ndɛ, ngam-a-ngam wu angal m'epal.»<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal y'ɔ̃kal ayɛɛn ndiri: «Ya!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Yɔɔl kwɛn wu ayoo ayɛɛn ndiri: «Ya!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Yɔɔl kwɛn wa ye nzuaal aya! Wu odzii k'anywã ãdza m'elaã, awal mɔ̃ ngwel!<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãyɛɛn mã ntɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Mɛ̃ wu Dzaã ewa ãnkunkwa me mbuul ɔ̃bi pyɛ wu ayoo ãndɔɔ m'ãfi ola Nziã, m'akel onse ɔ̃nkaan wu. Okɛɛn mbuul olweel ndɔɔ onse mɔ̃, Nziã àlweel ndɛ eyiri bvi asuo onse ɔ̃nkaan wu. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Okɛɛn hɛ̃ mbuul ombaal ndɔɔ onse ãndɔɔ m'ãfi ola Nziã, m'akel onse ɔ̃nkaan wu, Nziã àmbaal boo li ndɛ li nsia yi ɔ̃ti wu elaã bvool akii ndɛ nkuul yi asam onse Bviil li Ngel, m'emfa ki akel onse ɔ̃nkaan wu.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Wu atsweel ãndɔɔ mã olieel ndiri: «Ngwanya, mɛ̃ ŋ'esa eya!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Amɛn! Mfam Yeso, ya!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Mfam Yeso asio byɛ bueel nyiĩ!<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>